<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Maarko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maarko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Maarko fiis</para>
  <para style="mt">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Maarko fiis</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Maarko ɓaaheeɗi ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu, waaye kahan yaay ɓa nikee cohohaaniŋ ɓi Janguuniŋ Yerusalem ŋ kiis ca taamb ŋ hultiŋ Yeesu,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Tum ci 12:12</ref></char></note> te ŋ mirndaani a huniɗ na Pool na Barnabaas<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:4-13">Tum ci 13:4-13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:36-39">15:36-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Ɓi Kolos 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2 Timoote 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filemoon 1:24</ref></char></note> na Piyeer.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">1 Piyeer 5:13</ref></char></note> Naandsuk ciŋ Janguuni woo ne a fiis in ci Piyeer meeɗ woo. Ɓo' laayiɗ woo ne fu marak findi a naandsukoh ɗah, a kooɗ woyohaaɗiŋ ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char>, ɓi inheeɗi baahiɗ woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ciŋ Israayel.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maarko cambohɗi ŋ raakuukiŋ Yeesu na ɗiski a puloh. A camboh ŋ pangkiŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char>, ɓoktohi. A naandsuk in ci Yeesu haɓiɗ ŋ kehƴi, na in ci a jangɗoh, na kakaan kiŋ ɗe, na hultiŋ ɗe. Yeesu yegɗeen ɓooɓa woo kiŋ Kooh, a wirɗeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca, a aañeeɗa <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniica</char>, a tumeeɗa in feyohiɗ ca uupee haf caŋ ɓooɓa. Ini a fiis wa mand na ini Macce na Luk fiis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Maarko fiis kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓeeɗkohiŋ Yahya na ɓoktukiŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Seytaani jaɗɗiɗ Yeesu fiir <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nikaŋ Yeesu ŋ Galile na ɓak caŋ <char style="w" lemma="Tiir">Tiir na Sidoon</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14–9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pulaŋ Yeesu ŋ Galile ne a kaɗ Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Aasaŋ Yeesu Yerusalem po kakaan kiŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11:1–15:47</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Hultiŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Finho hultiŋ Yeesu. <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Cambohaaniŋ Yegɗohiŋ Muci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />
    <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: findi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyoha, ŋ camba, e Kooh dong nikee te Yeesu yi Woo kiŋ ɗe, nikee nga ɗe (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1">Saaŋ 1</ref></char>). Yeesu, findi a hayoh Adina, wa ɗalohiɗ na findi ɓooɓi na hayohe nga ; a raakɗi baabu ŋ kehƴi. A Kooh tum po a rimukka ŋ ɓitiɓ inhaaɗi ƴaar te malaakaani gapoh raakuukiŋ ɗe woo ne a hey ɓeeɗkohse Kuɓkiŋ yi Ɗafkiɗi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Macce 1:18-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:26-56">Luk 1:26-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:1-20">2:1-20</ref></char>) kon ini a puloh ŋ Kooh weɗ tah a ɓeeɗkohsee Kuɓkiŋ Kooh. Kuɓkiŋ Kooh, wa tokisɗi ne Kooh ɓay faan a rimmba kuɓu na ɓitiɓ findi ɓo'.</note>, camboh an : <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ngaŋ findi wa fiisohu ŋ teerndiŋ woosuuɗi Esayi ne :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">« Marka, ŋ hey tuuƴe woosuuɗiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">a adug ɗa, ne a haɓɗiɗ ɗa waasi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:20">Pula 23:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malasi 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />E hoosoora na leehke ŋ nduufa an :</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">“ Paɗaat waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">haɓɗiɗaat ɗe waas ci, ca yurah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esayi 40:3</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ŋ ineem <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yahya Ɓoktohi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi Saaŋ <char style="tl">Batiis</char> ŋ farañse.</char></note> hotukka, a ɓokteeɗa ɓooɓa na masuɓ ŋ nduufa. A inhiɗeeɗa ɓa ne ɓa hayaat ɓa ɓoktuk, wa teeɓoh ne ɓa teyiɗ ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ, ɓa min ɗaasu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ɓooɓa genee Yudee na ɓaŋ Yerusalem jen, kaɗeeɗa nga ɗe. Ɓa teyɗukeeɗa bakaaɗ caŋ ɓa, a ɓokteeɗa ɓa ŋ kalaŋ Yurdan.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yahya meeɗ ɓekuk kulɓa haɓɗohuuɗ find ngeelemb, a toka ŋ kinoh kiŋ ɗe na und. A meeɗta ñam paƴ na yeeleel kuum. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />A yegɗoheeɗa an : « Raakiɗ ɓoyi na haye ŋ finhooso, a yi uup po yak, ŋ yeyyooɗi nik <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ɗe ne ŋ hiir ŋ toksiɗee ɗe liiɓ ciŋ ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mi na ɓoktee ɗu na masuɓ waaye a yi, a ɓoktohan ɗu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>. »<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓoktukaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ŋ jamanoonaam, Yeesu pulohha kur ka na woyse Nasareet ŋ Galile, Yahya Ɓoktohi ɓokitta ɗe ŋ Yurdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Wa Yeesu pulee ŋ masma, a hotta Eel ci faarkiɗ, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh yipkeeɗa nga ɗe ŋ mandohaaɗ banuut. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Hooso kurkoh ŋ Eel ci kerhukka an : « A fu Kuɓkiŋ ngo ŋ waaɗ keeh-keeh te ŋ neɓuuɗ nga ɗa lool. »<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seytaani jaɗɗiɗ Yeesu fiir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Jaarra Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani hiirra Yeesu ŋ kaɗ nduufa. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />A nikka nga neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40), Seytaani jaɗɗeeɗa ɗe fiir. A nikee ŋ ɗiska inah ne ca ɗoopaat-nduuf dong nikee nga, malaakaaca taambkoheeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taalubeeci Yeesu koc ɓeeɗuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ŋ jamanoona Yahya Ɓoktohi rangohu ŋ kasoona, weɗ Yeesu kaɗoh Galile, a woyeeɗa Yegɗohiŋ Muci, wi puloh ŋ Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />An : « Jamanooni gapsee reyiɗ. Nguuriŋ-Kooh reɓiɗ ! Ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ te ɗu kos Yegɗohiŋ Muci ! »<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Wa raakka mbeh, a hunnda na sereendaŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, a kaɗeeɗa. A hotta seeɓoh kanak mbaaleeɗa cuurund ; ɓa nikee Simong na taambɗoh ce Andare. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ñaakɗaat to, ŋ hey ɗu tume ɗu nik seeɓoh ɓo'. » <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ɓa jaarra faɗ mbaal caŋ ɓa ndaam, ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />A kaɗissa ƴissuut, a hotta kuɓuuciŋ Sebede ŋ gaal haɓiɗtineeɗa mbaal caŋ ɓa ; ɓa nikee Saak na taambɗoh ce Saaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />A jaarra ɓa ɓeeɗuk ne ɓa ñaakiɗ ɗe. Ɓa faɗta baab ɓa Sebede na pangkoh caŋ ɗe ŋ gaala, ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu saɓsohiɗ ƴaar na jiinnda ambee ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Wa taalubeeca ñaakiɗ Yeesu, a hunnda na ɓa kur ka na woyse Kapernawum. Ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, a aassa ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>, a jangɗoheeɗa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ɓooɓa feyuusa ŋ jangɗohaŋ ɗe. Jangɗohaaɗaŋ ɗe ɗaloheen na findi jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na tumohe, laam a woyee keeh-keeh findi kilifa.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Teemb ndeem, wa raakeen ƴaar ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>, a <char style="w">jiini</char> ambee ɗe. A leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> an : <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />« Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet, waas fu ye nga ɓoo ? Fu hay ne fu yah ɓoo e ? Ŋ inhiɗ ɓoyi fu nikoh, a fu Ɓoyi Hooliɗi Kooh woos. » <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yeesu ngassa ɗe an : « Ɗeka te fu pul ngaŋ ƴaari ! » <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Jiinnda, na hoolaaɗiika a hoolaaɗi, a pulla ngaŋ ƴaara, a ambsohhaa na sesoh na yoondiɗ ɗe keeh-keeh. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ɗiska jen feyuusa, tahha po ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Inii min na nikoh ? Wii deey, wa jangɗoh as, wa hun na hatil ! A na woye woo na jiiniici, ca tum ini a woo. » <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Wa taambohha ndeem, tiikiŋ Yeesu laamtohseeɗa ŋ kur caŋ Galile jen.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ kosaayiɗ laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe puloh ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, Saak na Saaŋ hunee na ɗe, ɓa kaɗta kahan ɓi Simong na Andare. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Wa a ree, a raak yaayiŋ ɓiti Simong ŋ fiƴaang, faaniŋ ɗe dohee doh, Yeesu woyuusaa. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yeesu reɓpa nga ɗe, a ammba ɗe ŋ yaah, a kurkiɗta ɗe, dohɗaŋ faana saɓsukohha na ɗe po a taambkoheeɗa ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Na niina, wa noha muy, a komuusa kosaayiɗ ca jen, na ɓa jiini ambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ɓi kur ka jen cohha ŋ nguɓu kahna. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />A wiriɗta ɓo' laayiɗ na kosaay ɗalohiɗ. A nammba aañ jiini laayiɗ, a faɗɗi ca ne ca woo ; ca inhee inah ɓoyi a nikoh weɗ tah.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ŋ ɗooƴ weka, bala Kooh wiisan ɗah, a kurukka, a kaɗta ŋ ɗisik ɗaayiɗ, a kiimeeɗa Kooh nga. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simong na huntoh caŋ ɗe kaɗta ɗe waaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Wa ɓa hot ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓooɓi jen na waakee ɗa. » <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo kaɗaat ŋ kur ci cinooci reɓ ndii, ŋ woo Yegɗohiŋ Muci nga, findi ŋ woyoha ŋ ndii ; ineem weɗ tah ho hay. » <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ŋ ineem, a kaɗta ŋ ɗisik nu ɗisik ŋ Galile, a yegɗoheeɗaa ngaŋ <char style="tl">sinaagog</char> ca, a aañeeɗa jiiniica.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaara kosaay kaŋ ɗe tahee ɗe nik ɓo' hoolaaɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Yeesu kaɗeeɗa, ƴaar kosaayiɗ <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> hayya, ƴekka ŋ fikiice, kiimmba ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗa ɗah, fu miniɗ to saɓsoh na kosaay kii po ŋ nik ɓo' hooliɗ. » <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />A misikka Yeesu lool, Yeesu raɗissa yaah, a degga ɗe wa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ waaɗiɗa, hoola ! » <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, kosaay ka saɓsukohha na ƴaara, a hoolla. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43-44" />Ƴutta Yeesu woosa ɗe ne a kaɗaat, a dennga ɗe na woo ndengiɗ an : « Wortukaa wa woo ali ɓo', kaɗa fu teeɓa haf fu <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char>, fu haɓiɗ seeƴki waasiŋ Musaa nakoh<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:43-44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lewiici 14:1-32</ref></char></note> ne fu hool, wa teeɓoh ne fu wiriɗ. » <verse eid="MRK 1:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Waaye ƴaara cootta, a woyeeɗaa, tahha po wa yooɓisseeɗi ne Yeesu aas ŋ kur. A nikka ŋ nduufa, ɓooɓa puloheeɗa ɗisik nu ɗisik raakeeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ lafñiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Wa degga ɓi neeh, Yeesu dokukka Kapernawum. Ɓooɓa kerahha ne a yaa ŋ kahan ɓa, <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />mboolo laayiɗ cohha ŋ ɗiska, wa riiffa po, nikoha sah raakisseeɗi ŋ nguɓu kahna. A woyeeɗa ɓa woo kiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ɗekka po ɓa kommba ɗe ƴaar lafñiɗ, ƴaar nikiis ɓeɗ gaalɗohee ɗe ŋ faankoha. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ɓa minɗi ree na ɗe ŋ Yeesu sagu findi ɓooɓa laayohe, tahha po ɓa nihissa ŋ poonaŋ taɓaha teemb ŋ ɗiska Yeesu nike, ɓa yoorra ƴaara nga na faankohaanaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Wa Yeesu hot ɓa na findi ɓa kosoh, a woosa lafñiɗa ne : « Ƴaariŋ ngo, fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Raak ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> ɓoofiɗ. Ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa an : <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />« Ƴaarii a kaañoh woo ineem na ? A ɗalee Kooh. Ali ɓo' minɗi ɗaasoh bakaaɗ ɗal Kooh dong ! » <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yeesu jaarra inah ina ɓa liiɓee ŋ ɗooƴ hel ciŋ ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu raakee liiɓohaaɗ mand ɗaa ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ŋ woo ƴaarii ne : “ Fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa ” wala ŋ woo ɗe ne : “ Kurka, ɓaya faankohaaniŋ ɗa, fu tiind. ” A winde uup yooɓ ? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Waaye, ne ɗu inah ne <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> raakiɗ hatili a min ɗaasoh bakaaɗ ŋ kehƴi - markaat rek. » A woosa ƴaara ne : <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />« Ñam woo ɗa wa, kurka fu ɓay faankohaaniŋ ɗa, fu haad. » <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, ƴaara kurukka ŋ fiki ɓooɓa, a ɓayya faankohaanaŋ ɗe, a pulla. Ɓooɓa jen feyuusa, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ɓoo hotohɗi in mand an ! »<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓeeɗkiɗ Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yeesu dokkissa ŋ ɓakaŋ cookma. Ɓooɓa jen raakeeɗa ɗe nga, a jangɗeeɗa ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Wa Yeesu kaɗe, a hotta Lewi kuɓkiŋ Alfe, ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɗiska a na juuti'ohe. A woosa ɗe ne : « Ñaakiɗ to. » Lewi kurukka, ñaakiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu nikka ŋ kahan Lewi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a ñameeɗa na ɓa na <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> laayiɗ na bakaaɗoh laayiɗ ; ɓo' laayiɗ mand ɗaa nikee ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Jangɗohoh caŋ waasi ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca hotta ɗe ñameeɗa na ɓooɓeem, ɓa woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah kilifaaniŋ ɗu ñamee na juuti'oh ci na bakaaɗoh ci ? » <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yeesu kerahha ɓa, a loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi kosaayɗi etohɗi paƴoh, e kosaayiɗ ci etoh paƴoh. Ŋ hayɗi ne ŋ ɓeeɗuk ɓooɓi yurhiɗ ci waaye ŋ hay ne ŋ ɓeeɗuk bakaaɗoh ci. »<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oraaɗiikaŋ taalubeeciŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Wa raakka mbeh, taalubeecaŋ <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca oreeɗa. Ɓi ɓo' hayya ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Wee tah hey ɗah taalubeeciŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi na ɓiŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ore, ɓiŋ ɗa oruu ? » <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Hanheeci hay kilook miniɗ or te raak heɗ kilooki yii na ɓa e ? Wa minɗi nik, feeh a yii na ɓa ɗah. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Waaye, wa hey raake jamano heɗ kilooki kooɗohu nga ɓa, ŋ ndeem, ɓa hey ore.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Ali ɓo' na daafeeɗi kulɓa maañiɗ na seeket as ; mbaa seeketi hey nookɗohe kulɓaaki, kulɓaaki uup nga faaruk. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ali ɓo' na nameeɗi tum biiñi asi na soñe ŋ mbohos und maañiɗ ; mbaa biiñi asi hey pooke mbohoseem, biiñi na mbohosi jen yahrukoh. Biiñ as joy tumu ŋ mbohos as. »<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu, Heɗ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Wa nikee ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗeeɗa, ɓa taammba ŋ yohon caŋ beleeca. Ŋ waasa, taalubeeciŋ ɗe piikeeɗa nga ca. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" /><char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca woosa ɗe ne : « Marka, wa ye tah taalubeeciŋ ɗa haɓɗee ini waasiŋ ɓoo sangoh ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse ? » <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Mand haa ne ɗu moosɗi jangoh ina Dawuuda haɓɗee wa a aɗuk, a raakɗi ñamaah, a yi na ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />A aas ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>. Wa nikee ŋ jamanoonaŋ Abiyatar, seeƴkiɗoha yakka. Dawuuda ɓayya mbuuruuca degsee ŋ taaɓla wuu Kooh a ñammba nga ca, a nammba eɗ ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samuwel 21:1-6</ref></char></note> Te ali ɓo' joyɗi ñam mbuuruuceem ɗal <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lewiici 24:9</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />A degiɗta ɓa nga ne : « A ɓo' tah mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse waaku, mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse tahɗi ɓo' feru. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kon mbaa Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi a yi Heɗ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse sah. »<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ heɗ yaah ɓeendkiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu aasissa <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>. Ndaam, ƴaar nikeen nga yaahiŋ ɗe ɓeendkee ɓeenduk. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ɓum markiɗeeɗa Yeesu andi a hey wirɗe ƴaara ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, ɓa raak yambaah ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />A woosa ƴaara na yaaha ne : « Kurka fu tufuk ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen. » <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ƴutta Yeesu meekissa ɓa ne : « Wa ye teyɗohu ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, in baahiɗ wala in baahaaɗi, ɓo' joy joy hirpu nga wala a joy joy apu ? » Waaye ɓa lofɗi ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />A markeeɗa ɓa na ayruk, a raakka neɓsaaɗi ŋ ndenga keeñ caŋ ɓa ndenge. A woosa ƴaara ne : « Raɗsa yaahiŋ ɗa. » A raɗissaa, wa wirra peng. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" /><char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca jaarra pul, ɓa kaɗta hotoha na ɓa langee na buur Herod, ne ɓa marak findi ɓa joy ɗe apoh.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɗaakɗukiɗ gaal ƴin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7-8" />Ŋ jamanooneem, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗta nika ɓakaŋ cookma, mboolo keeh-keeh puloh Galile hunnda na ɗe. Raakka ɓa kerah in ca a tumee, tahha po ɓa pulohha kur caŋ Yudee, Yerusalem, na kur caŋ Idime, na caŋ ɓaka faahaŋ kalaŋ Yurdan, na ina wil Tiir na Sidoon, ɓa nammba coh ŋ ɗiska na ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 3:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />A woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa ɗaakɗohaahaat ɗe gaal ƴin ; a sangee ne mboolnda baɓuk ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Wirɗa a wirɗee kosaayiɗ laayiɗ, weɗ tahee po ɓa raakee kosaay jen, giirkeeɗa giiruk nga ɗe ne ɓa laal ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Te <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> hotta ɗe ɗah, ca fol ɓooɓi ca amb ŋ fikiice, ca leehkiɗukohee ɓa ne : « A fu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>. » <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Waaye Yeesu meeɗta ca ngas baahiɗ ne ca kinaat ɗe teeɓoh.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu taniɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ndaŋkiyaah na kanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kurkohha ndeem, Yeesu rappa ŋ ɗafuk tango, a ɓeeɗukka ɓi ɓo' ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe, ɓa hayya nga ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />A kooɗta nga ɓa ɓo' ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ne ɓa nik na ɗe [a teekka ɓa "<char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char>"]. A tuuƴee ɓa, ne ɓa woya <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ɓa aañee jiiniici, a eɗta ɓa hatili. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) a kooɗee nike : Simong yi a teekee Piyeer ; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Saak na Saaŋ, kuɓuuciŋ Sebede ; Yeesu teekee ɓa Bowanerses wi tokis kuɓu inding ; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />na Andare, na Filip, na Bartalemi, na Macce, na Tomaa, na Saak kuɓkiŋ Alfe, na Tade, na Simong yi nikee <char style="tl">Selot</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Selot</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ɓoyi waaɗ kur ce po a ƴutiɗ ne a hiñohiɗa.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yudaa Iskaryot yi wor ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na kilifaaniŋ jiiniici</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Wa raakka mbeh, ɓi Yeesu aassa kahan, mboolo cohissa nga po a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe minɗi ñam. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ɓi kahan ɓa yeggaa, ɓa kaɗta ɗe ɓaya, ɓa woyee ne : « Hafiŋ ɗe riifisɗi. »<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, ɓi pulohee Yerusalem woosa ne : « A Belsebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belsebul </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa ɓaah ŋ tiik ciŋ Seytaani.</char></note> na ɗe ! » Ɓa woyissa ne : « Hatiliŋ kilifaaniŋ jiiniici weɗ a na aañohe jiiniici. » <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ŋ ineem Yeesu ɓeeɗukka ɓa, a woosa ɓa ŋ andiin ne : « Seytaani min na aañoh haf ce ? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ɓooɓi ɓaah nguur hiñohee ŋ harmban ɓa ɗah, nguureem minanɗi tufuk. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Te ɓooɓi ɓaah kahan hiñohee ŋ harmban ɓa ɗah, kahneem minanɗi tufuk. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kon, wa nik ne Seytaani na hiñohe ŋ ɗooƴ ce ɗah, nguuriŋ ɗe hey paysukohe te wa heeɗi minise tufuk, wa heen reehɗukohe. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ali ɓo' minɗi aas ŋ kahan ɓo' raakiɗ hatil, a ɓay in ciŋ ɗe, te a tokɗi ɗe po a ndeng. Waaye a tok ɗe ɗah, a hey ɓaye in ciŋ kahan ce jen.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓooɓi ɗaasnuk ɗah, ɓa hey ɗaasse bakaaɗ nu bakaaɗ na ɗal nu ɓa ɗal Kooh ɗah. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Waaye ɓo' nu ɗal <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, a ɗaassanɗi bakaaɗeem muk, wa taambɗan ɗe taambiɗ po faw. » <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yeesu woyiɗ ineem sagu ina ɓa woyee ne a jiini na ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na ɓi kahan ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Weɗi yaay ɓa na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe reyoh, ɓa tufukka ŋ hara, ɓa nakohha ɗe ɓeeɗkiɗu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Raak mboolnda ɓoofiɗ wiliɗ ɗe, a woyuusa ne : « Tassa yaay ɗu na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓa ɗaa ŋ hara na meeksohee ɗa. » <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />A loffa ne : « Ɗu amb ne a ɓa yaay ɓoo, e ɓinde taambɗoh ciŋ ngo ? » <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />A marakka ɓooɓi wil ɗe, a woosa ne : « Ɓooɓii, ɓeɗ yaay ɓoo, ɓeɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ɓo' nu na haɓɗe ini Kooh waaɗ ɗah, ɓoyeem a taambɗoh ho ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ, wala yaay ɓoo. »<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ sokohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Wa raakissa mbeh, Yeesu nikka ŋ sereendaŋ cookma, a jangɗoheeɗa. Mboolnda wilee ɗe laayya lool, po a mirndohha rap ŋ gaal, a ɓooffa nga ; a nikka ŋ masma, mboolnda nikka ŋ sereenda. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />A jangɗeeɗa ɓa ŋ andiin inaa laayiɗ, a woosa ɓa ŋ ɗooƴ jangɗoha ne :<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />« Sikɗukaat ! A nikee guuroh, a kaɗta soka. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Wi a soke, a saaweeɗa tisohi, in nga hennda ŋ waasi ŋ ɗooƴ yohni, sel ci hayya ñammbaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Raakka ci keen ŋ ɗisik laayaaɗi merhey, raakiɗ atoh, tahha po ca arra paar, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />waaye wi nohi dam, in ca paaree leeɓpa po ca onnja sagu ini ca raakeeɗi niir nooɗiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />In ŋ tisohi nammba keen ŋ ɗisik raakiɗ ñaaɓaaɓ ; ca paarandoosa na ñaaɓaaɓ ca, ceem ndooƴca ca po ca raakɗi ali rim. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Waaye raakka ci keen ŋ keheƴ baahiɗ, ca paarra, ca yakka, ca rimmba, cum eɗohha rim ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30), cum ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60), cum teemet (100). » <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu raak nof kerhoha ɗah, a kerhaat. »<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Wa a saɓsukoh na mboolnda po a nikka na taalubeeci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) na ɓooɓa meeɗ nik na ɗe, ɓa meekissa ɗe ini kaɗ ŋ andiin ceem. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu onuuɗ ne ɗu inah ini ɗasɗukiɗiŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. Waaye ɓaahaaɗiici na rahse in ci jen ngaŋ andiin <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">“ ɓa markee baahiɗ, ɓa minuu hot ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">ɓa sikɗukee baahiɗ, ɓa minuu inah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Ŋ ineem, ɓa ɓoƴsohuu kipes</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">po Kooh kee ɓa ɗaasa bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esayi 6:9-10</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inahɗi ini andiinii tokis e ? Kon, ne ɗu inah ci tas jen wa hey miske nga ɗu ! <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Sokohi na soke woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ɓum ɓeɗ ŋ sero waasi, ɗiski Woo ki saawu ; ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe woo kiŋ Kooh, Seytaani jaar hay, nihisa nga ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Ɓum ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ kehƴi raak atoh ci ; ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa jaara teyɗuk na keeñ soosiɗ, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />waaye ɓa na raakeeɗi niir ŋ haf ɓa, ɓa na maañeeɗi nga. Ɓa raak miskiɗ wala ɓa tolfiɗassee sagu Woo ki ɗah, ɓa ar faɗ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ɓum ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ ñaaɓaaɓ ci ; ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa teyɗuka, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />waaye liiɓsiɗoh ci, na raak-raak ci na njuyohe, na waaɗ neɓiɗ ciŋ Adina, amb ɓa po Woo ki minuu rim ali in. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ɓinooɓi ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ kehƴi baahiɗi ; ɓeɗ ɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa teyɗuka. Ɓa raak rim, ɓum ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30), ɓum ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60), ɓinooɓi teemet (100). »<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laampaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Laampa na ɓayse ne wa kunu na kanoh wala wa ɗaaku ŋ ooɓ fiƴaangi e ? Wa na degse ŋ degohaaniŋ wa kay ! <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />In nu ɗembɗu ɗah, wa ɗembɗu ne mbeh hey haye, wa teeɓohu. In nu ɗasɗu ɗah, wa ɗasɗu ne mbeh hey haye, wa teeɓohu noh cong. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ɓo' nu raak nof kerhoha ɗah, a kerhaat. »<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />A woyissa ɓa ne : « Markissaat baahiɗ ini ɗu na kerhe ! Inhaat ne, ɓeesohaani ɗu na ɓeesɗohohe, weɗ ɗu ɓeesɗohsan, ƴut ɗah, ɗu ɓaatu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Laam ɓoyi raak hey ɓaatse, waaye ɓoyi raakɗi, ini ƴissuuti a amb sah hey naafse nga ɗe. »<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tisoh ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Nguuriŋ-Kooh mand na inii : A nikee ɓo', a sokka tisoh ŋ yohon. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ƴutta, a taalndiɗta, wek reesa ɗah a neehe, noh ɗah a kuruk. Tisoha paarra po wa yakka te a inahɗi findi wa kaɗoh po wa hennda ɗaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />A merhey mi ŋ haf wa paariɗa, wa raakka pok, wa ɓiɗissa, wa marakka ; <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />wa ruunnda rek, a inahha ne nguɗ reyiɗ, a ɓayya japil, a nguɗtaa. »<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tisohiŋ mutardaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yeesu woyissa ne : « Ɓoo min mandtiɗkoh Nguuriŋ-Kooh na ye ? Ɓoo mina teeɓoh na winde andiin ? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Wa mand na kuɓu mutarda, wa sokuusa ɗah, weɗ na uupe ƴissuut ŋ tisoh ciŋ kidig ci ƴin ci na sokse ŋ nguuk jen, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />waaye wa sokuusa po wa paarra ɗah, wa yak po wa uup ca, wa raak naak yakak po sel ci min taar ŋ saangniŋ wa. »<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yeesu jangɗohohee ɓa ɗaa, ŋ andiin laayiɗ findi andiin cii, a jangɗeeɗa ɓa in hend na ini haf ciŋ ɓa min amb. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />A woyeeɗi na ɓa ŋ ini nikɗi andiin, waaye a ɗaayya na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ɗah, a toksiɗ ɓa ca jen.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu yeeɓkiɗiɗ cookma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mbaɗi, wa noha muy, Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɓoo kaɗaat ŋ ɓaka faahaŋ cookma. » <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ɓa faɗta mboolnda ndaam, taalubeeciŋ ɗe ɓayya ɗe na gaala a nikohe, ɓi gaal wiiriis hunnda na ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ɗekka po pahul yakak kurukka, ginaah ca laɓkeeɗa ŋ gaala po wa riifiɗta na masuɓ. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Raak Yeesu neeheeɗa ŋ lecmaŋ gaala, a ooɓpa tiknukoha ŋ hafiŋ ɗe ; taalubeeciŋ ɗe yunnda ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, sooƴi ɓoo na sooƴe wii, tumɗi ɗa in e ? » <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Wa a yunu, a ngassa puuɗsa, a woosa cookma ne : « Yeeɓka ! Seema ! » Puuɗsa seemmba, ɗiska eennda teɗ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Ƴutta a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu neek ? Ɗu ris kosɗi poyi e ? » <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ɓa feyuusa lool, ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ƴaarii joy nik ɓa po puuɗsi na cookmi sah kerhiɗee ɗe ? »<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaara jiiniica ambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ree ɓaka faahaŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, ngaŋ kur kaŋ Geraas ca, <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />a pulee pul ŋ gaala rek, ƴaar, yi fu inah ne e <char style="w">jiini</char> ambee ɗe, kurkohha ɗiska a nikee ŋ ruy-ruy ca, kaɗta coha na ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />A genee nga ca, ɓo' minisseeɗi ɗe ndengiɗ, ali a toku na ceen sah. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />A meeɗ meeɗ nguɗsoh ceen ci yaah ciŋ ɗe meeɗ tokohu daggid, a pooksoh jatngiŋ kot ciŋ ɗe muƴ ; ali ɓo' mineeɗi ɗe ndengiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />A nikangee noha na weka ŋ ruy-ruy ca na tangooca, a leehke, a gaañee haf ce na atoh.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Wa a ƴok Yeesu, a kaɗta coha na ɗe na mbup, a ƴekka ŋ fikiice. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />A leehukka ŋ ɗafka ne : « Yeesu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka, fu nar ye nga so ? Mi yii kiim ɗa po ŋ fiki Kooh, kinaa so deg miskiɗ. » <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />A woyiɗ ineem sagu ne Yeesu woyee ɗe ne : « Jiinndi, pula ŋ ƴaarii na hoolaaɗiikiŋ ɗa ! » <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yeesu meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu teeku na ? » A loffa ɗe ne : « <char style="tl">Lesiyong</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">lesiyong</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> ɗeɓgaan, weɗ soldaar junni junni.</char></note> weɗ tiikiŋ ngo, laayi ɓoo laay, weɗ tah. » <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />A kiimeeɗa Yeesu keeh-keeh ne a kinaat ca cootiɗ ɗisik usiɗ.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Raak gat mbaam-huk ñameeɗa ŋ sero tangoora. Wa nikee gat yakak. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Jiiniica kiimmba Yeesu keeh-keeh an : « Yurhiɗa ɓoo ŋ mbaam ci, ne ɓoo aas nga ca. » <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />A onnda ca ineem, ca pulla ŋ ƴaara, ca aassa ŋ mbaam ca. Mbaam ca ɗaleen ree junni-kanak (2000) wala ca uupa. Gata jen giirukka, hunnda na mbartala, faɗsukka ŋ cookma, mbaam ca lappa nga. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Ɓooɓa niiɗee ca nuppa, kaɗtaa woya ŋ kur-taaha na kur ca ƴin ca.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:14">Wa ɓooɓa hay marke, <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />ɓa kaɗta ŋ Yeesu, ɓa raakka ƴaara jiiniica laayiɗ ca ambee ɓoofiɗ moɗoɗ, ɓekkiɗ kulɓa, a hunnda na sagooniŋ ɗe ; ɓa neƴƴohha. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ɓa maasoh ina findi wa raakoh jen, naandsukka ɓooɓa ina rahas ƴaara jiiniica ambee na mbaam ca. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ŋ ineem ɓa kiimeeɗa Yeesu ne a pulaat kur caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Wa Yeesu aasee ŋ gaala ne a coot, ƴaara a saɓsohee na jiiniica kiimmba ɗe ne : « On ndo ŋ kaɗ na ɗa. » <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Waaye Yeesu teyɗukiɗɗi ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Kaɗa kahan ɗu, fu ree ɗah, fu naandsuk ɓa ini Heɗi haɓɗiɗ ɗa ŋ miski fu misik ɗe. » <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ƴaara kaɗta, a naandsukeeɗa ina Yeesu haɓɗiɗ ɗe ŋ kur caŋ Dekapool<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapool </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa nikee kur-taah ndaŋkiyaah nangɗukohiɗ. Ɓooɓi genee nga, ɓa nikee Yawuut haa, ɓa taambɗeeɗi <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>.</char></note> ; ɓooɓa jen feyuusa ŋ ineem.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hultiɗuukaŋ kuɓkaŋ Jayrus na ɓitɓa laalee kulɓaakaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Wa Yeesu kooɗ gaal po a dokkissa ŋ ɓakaŋ winooraŋ cookma, a reyee ree, a tufukka ŋ sereendaŋ cookma. Mboolo yakak cohissa ŋ ɗiska na ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ƴaar teeku Jayrus, ɓaah ŋ kilifaaca adgohee <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>, reyeeɗa. Wi a hot Yeesu, a ƴekka ŋ kot ciŋ yeem, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />a kiimeeɗa ɗe kiim miskiɗ an : « Kuɓkiŋ ngo cafƴi yaa kaaneeɗa, haya hay rek fu degiɗ to ɗe yaah ciŋ ɗa, a wir, a min pes. » <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ɓa hunnda, ɓa kaɗeeɗa. Mboolo yakiɗ ñaakiɗta Yeesu, ɓa baɓkeeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda, ɓitiɓ nikeen nga, ñif miŋ ɗe meeɗ meeɗ aamuk. A tumiɗ na kosaay keem kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak (12). <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />A yaaɓeen lool ŋ yaah paƴoh laayiɗ ; ina a raakee jen a tumeena nga ɓa, waaye a ngisoheeɗi ; a uupeeɗa nga uup kosaay. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />In ca a kerhee ɓooɓi woyeeɗa ca ŋ Yeesu tahha po a huussa ŋ mboolnda, a lahha ɗe finho ; a laalla kulɓaakaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Raak a woyee ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Ali ŋ laal kulɓaakiŋ ɗe dong, ŋ hey wire. »<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Wa a laal kulɓaakaŋ Yeesu, ŋ saasi saasi ñif maŋ ɗe aamkisɗi, a yegga ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne a wiriɗ. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Yeesu nammba jaar yeg ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne raakiɗ hatili puloh nga ɗe. A mbiliirukka ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda, a woosa ne : « Ya ɓa laal kulɓaakiŋ ngo ? » <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Moo fu hot ŋ ɓooɓi, ɓa wil ɗa wil, fu meeksohee ɓoyi laal ɗa ! » <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Yeesu markeeɗa ŋ ini wil ɗe, ne a hot ɓoyi tum ineem. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ɓitɓa inahha ina rahas ɗe, a tiitta po a saakɗoheeɗa, a ƴekka ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu, a woosa ɗe keeh ka jen. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kosi fu kos wirɗiɗ ɗa ɓitɓi, kaɗa moɗoɗ, fu saɓsukohiɗ na miskiɗiŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Wa a woyee ineem, ɓi ɓo' pulohha kahan Jayrus, ɓa woosa yeem ne : « Wa etohisɗi fu yaaɓɗe Jangɗohohi, kuɓkiŋ ɗa kaaniɗ. » <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Waaye Yeesu taambkohɗi woo kaŋ ɓa, a woosa Jayrus ne : « Kina neƴƴoh, kosa rek ! » <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yeesu faɗɗi ali ɓo' ne a hun na ɗe ɗal Piyeer, Saak na Saaŋ yi taambɗoh Saak.<verse eid="MRK 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Wa ɓa ree kahan Jayrus, Yeesu hotta ne ɗuuɗaŋ ɓooɓa na aastiɗohaŋ ɓa miskiɗ lool ; ɓa rooyeeɗa, ɓa looƴkeeɗa. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />A aassa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye ɓek miskiɗuk cii na rooy cii ? Kuɓki kaanɗi, a na neehe. » <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ɓa njembteeɗa ɗe. Weɗ a pulɗoh ɓa jen, a hunnda na baab ɓi kuɓki na yaay ɓa na taalubeeci kaahay ci hunee na ɗe, a aassa na ɓa ŋ tuuƴa kuɓka nikoh. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />A ammba ɗe ŋ yaah, a woosa ɗe ne : « <char style="tl">Talita kumi</char> ! » Wa tokis : "Kuɓki cafƴi, ŋ woo na ɗa, kurka !" <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Njaanja jaarra kuruk, tiindeeɗa, ɓa feyuusa ŋ ineem lool. A raakeen kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak (12). <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yeesu dennga ɓa keeh-keeh ne ali ɓo' kinaata kerah. A woosa ɓa ne ɓa onaat kuɓka a ñam.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɓi Nasareet sangiɗ kos Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a kaɗta kur ka a yakoh, taalubeeciŋ ɗe hunnda na ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, a jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>. Ɓooɓa laayiɗ ca sikɗukee ɗe feyuusa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ini ƴaarii inah wii a ɓayoha nde ? A eɗu ki'inah ye wii ? Na keemaan ci a na haɓɗe ? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />A miniseeni, yi kuɓkiŋ Maryaama haa e ? A taambɗoh Saak na Yoose na Yuud na Simong haa e ? Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ ci nikɗi na ɓoo ndii e ? » Ineem weɗ tahee po ɓa minɗi ɗe teyɗuk.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Waaye Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Woosuuɗ na kerhiɗasse ŋ ɗisik ci jen po tas kur ka a genoh, na ɗooƴ ɓaah ciŋ ɗe na kahan ɓa. » <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Ineem tahha po Yeesu minɗi haɓiɗ keemaan nga, nikɗi dega a degee ɓi kosaayiɗ yaah ciŋ ɗe, a wirɗeeɗa ɓa ɗah. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />A feyuusa ŋ kosaaɗiikaŋ ɓa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yeesu tuuƴiɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a wileeɗa, a jangɗoheeɗa ŋ kur ca nikee ŋ ɓak caam. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />A ɓeeɗukka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), a tuuƴeeɗa ɓa kanak kanak ; a onnda ɓa hatil aañoha <char style="w">jiini</char>. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />A nakka ɓa ne : « Ɗu kaɗee ɗah, kinaat ɓayndoh ali in, ɗal ndooɗ ŋ yaah. Kinaat ɓay kañam, kinaat ɓay saak te kinaat ɓay kopor. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Ɓekkaat ñafaɗ, waaye kinaat ɓekuk kulɓa kanak. »<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />A woyissa ɓa ne : « Kahan nu ɗu daloh ɗah, nikaat nga po mbaɗna ɗu pulan kur ka. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Waaye ɗu teyɗukuuɗi ŋ ɗisik, ɓa sikɗukɗi ɗu ɗah, paangaat merhey miŋ kot ciŋ ɗu ne ɗu cootee ɗah, wa teeɓ ɓa ini ɓa haɓiɗ. »<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />
    <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kaɗta, ɓa woyeeɗa ɓooɓa ne ɓa ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ɓa aañeeɗa jiini laayiɗ, ɓa reefeeɗa diw ŋ haf jiriɗ gooñ, ɓa wirɗeeɗa ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />In ceem kaɗoh kaɗoh po Herod buura kerahha ca, raak tiikiŋ Yeesu wiliɗ kur. Ɓooɓa woyee ne : « Ƴaareem, a <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> ; a hultiɗu hultiɗu, weɗ tah a raakka hatil haɓɗoha in feyohiɗ ! » <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ɓum an : « A <char style="w">Ilyas</char>. » Ɓinooɓi woyeeɗa ne : « A woosuuɗ, findi woosuuɗ ca ɗeɓgaan. » <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herod kerah ineem, a woosa ne : « Ƴaareem, a Yahya Ɓoktohi, yi ŋ nguɗɗukee hafiŋ ɗe. A hultiɗu hultiɗu. »<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18" />A Herod yeem, a yi taƴɗukee Yahya sagu inii : A yi Herod, a kooɗee Herojaad, ɓiti taambɗoh ce Filip, a tummba ɗe ɓitiɓ. Yahya woyee na ɗe ŋ ineem an : « Waasiŋ Kooh teyɗohɗi ne fu ɓay ɓiti taambɗoh fu, fu tum ɗe ɓitiɓ. » <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:21">Lewiici 20:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:17-18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19-20" />Herojaad ambiɗta Yahya aay-keeñ ŋ ineem, a waaɗta ɗe apɗuk, waaye Herod neƴƴohee neƴƴoh Yahya te a inheen ne a ɓo' yurhiɗ, hooliɗ wuu Kooh. Tahha po a meeɗ ɗe meeɗ niiɗ po Herojaad mineeɗi ɗe apɗuk. Ɓaat nga, Yahya woyeesa ɗah, a yi Herod, a meeɗ meeɗ feyu lool ; hondohɗi a meeɗeen neɓu ŋ sikɗuk ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 6:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Kaɗeeɗa po mbeh, Herojaad raakka tondkoha ; wa nikee wa Herod yakɗee mbehi a raakohu. A yi Herod a haɓɗiɗukka kañam laayiɗ, a ɓeeɗukka dag caŋ ɗe na kilifaacaŋ soldaar ca na kilifaacaŋ Galile. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mbaɗi, kuɓkiŋ Herojaad ɓitɓi aassa ŋ ɗiska ɓa nikee, a mbeceeɗa, a neɓpa Herod na hanheecaŋ ɗe. Herod woosa kuɓka cafƴa ne : « Woo so ini fu waaɗ, ŋ hey ɗa wa one. » <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />A giñiɗta ɗe ineem, a woosa ɗe ne : « In nu fu meekis so ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa wa eɗe ; ali wa nik haaƴiŋ nguuriŋ ngo sah, ŋ eɗ ɗa wa. »<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kuɓka cafƴa pulla, woosa yaay ɓa ne : « Ŋ meeksan ɗe ye ? » Yaay ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Meeksaa ɗe hafiŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi. » <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Kuɓka cafƴa arra dokuk ŋ buura, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ waaɗ ne fu eɗ to win-win, ŋ palaat, hafiŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi. » <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Herod soossa waaye giña a giñee ŋ fiki hanheeca tahha po a minɗi ɗe wa sangiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />A jaarra woos soldaar, a nakka ɗe komu hafiŋ Yahya. Soldaara kaɗta, nguɗta hafiŋ Yahya ŋ ɗiska a nikee ŋ kasoona, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />a hayya naa ŋ palaat, a eɗta kuɓka cafƴa wa, yeem eɗtaa yaay ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Wa taalubeecaŋ Yahya kerah ineem, ɓa kaɗta, ɓa ɓayya fiɗaafaŋ ɗe, ɓa ɓekkaa ŋ ruy-ruy.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laayɗa Yeesu laayɗee mbuuruuca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca Yeesu tuuƴee, wa ɓa dokuk, ɓa cohha ŋ ɗiska na ɗe, ɓa naandsukka ɗe in ca ɓa haɓiɗ na in ca ɓa jangɗoh jen. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Hayaat ɓoo ɗaaya ŋ ɗisik eendiɗ, ɗu iɗsiɗuk ƴissuut. » Raak ɓa ɓo' laayiɗ ɓeɗ nikee nga, ɓum kaɗeesa ɗah, ɓum haye ; tahha po Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe rahasɗi ne ɓa ñam. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ɓa ɓayya gaal ne ɓa ɗaaya ŋ ɗisik eendiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Waaye ɓo' laayiɗ hotta ɓa kaɗeeɗa, inhissa ɓa ; ɓi kur caam jen nuppa, adugka ɓa ŋ ɗiska ɓa kaɗe.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ree po a ruhussa ŋ gaala, a hotta mboolo yakak, ɓa misikka ɗe lool ; ɓa mandee na mbaal raakaaɗi niiɗoh. A jangɗeeɗa ɓa in laayiɗ.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Wa niina ree, taalubeeciŋ ɗe reɓpa nga ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ndii wa bilaf, te Kooh yii hooɓeeɗa, <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />woya ɓooɓii ɓa kaɗ ŋ kur ci reɓ ndii ne ɓa rom ini ɓa joy ñam. » <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu, eɗaat ɓa ini ɓaa hee ñame. » Waaye ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo na hee ɓa kee romɗa mbuuru na hanjar <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> teemet-kanak (200) hanaa ? » <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu raak mbuuru hend na ? Kaɗaat ɗu marka. » Ɓa marakka, ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo raak mbuuru yatuus na cuurund kanak. »<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />A nakka ɓa ne ɓa ɓoofɗaat ɓooɓa jen rung rung ŋ paangfa iirnda. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ɓa ɓooffa teemet teemet (100-100) na ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50-50). <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />A ɓayya mbuuruuca yatuus ca na cuurund ca kanak ca, a marakka ŋ ɗafki, a corkiɗta Kooh. A nguɗsohha mbuuruuca, a eɗta taalubeeci ca ne ɓa paysoh ca mboolnda, a nammba tum cuurund ca ɗaa po ɓooɓa jen raakka. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ɓooɓa jen ñammba po ɓa kappa. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Wa ɓooɓa ñam po ɓa ƴutta, taalubeeca nangɗohha tasɗohiica po ɓa raakka ini mit pañe riifiɗ ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12). <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ƴaar ca ñamee ŋ ɗiska nikeen ŋ ɓak junni-yatuus (5000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tiindiɗ ŋ ɗafuk masma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Wa ɓa nangɗoh tasɗohiica po ƴutta, Yeesu jaarra, tufukka taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa aasaat ŋ gaala, ɓa adgohaah ɗe ŋ ɓakaŋ winooraŋ cookma, ŋ ɓak Betsayda ; a saɓsukoheeɗa na mboolnda.<verse eid="MRK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Wa a askoh na mboolnda po ƴutta, a kaɗta tango ne a kiima Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Wa weka ree, raak gaalaŋ taalubeeca ŋ leero cookma, Yeesu tassa kiik ce ŋ merhey ma suyɗa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />A hotta ne taalubeeca yaaɓiɗ ŋ joowaŋ ɓa na gaala, sagu puuɗsa yurhiɗkohee na ɓa. Ŋ wiisaaɗiina, a tiindeeɗa ŋ ɗafuk masma, a kaɗeeɗa nga ɓa po a heeɗa ɓa cootke. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49-50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49-50" />Ɓa jen, ɓa hotta ɗe tiindeeɗa ŋ ɗafuk cookma, ɓa liiɓpa ne a husiɗ, ɓa feyuusa keeh-keeh, ɓa leehkeeɗa. Jaarra, a jommba na ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Hunaat na sagoociŋ ɗu ! A ñam ! Kinaat neƴƴoh ! » <verse eid="MRK 6:49-50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />A kaɗta nga ɓa ŋ gaala, puuɗsa seemmba. Ŋ ineem, ɓa nikka feyuuɗ jameet ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa po ɓa inhisɗi in ci ɓa haɓɗan ; <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />raak ɓa ambɗi ali in ŋ ina a haɓɗee na mbuuruuca. E ndengaŋ ɓa keeñ tahe.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Wa ɓa reehiɗ ƴakaanduk cookma, ɓa teerra ŋ kur kaŋ Senesaret. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ɓa yipuk yipuk rek, ɓooɓa inhissa Yeesu, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />ɓa nupeeɗa, ɓa aaseeɗa ŋ kur caŋ ɓak caam jen. Ŋ ɗisik nu ɓa kerahha ne a yaa nga ɗah, ɓa komee ɗe kosaayiɗ ca nga, faanuuɗ ŋ faankoha. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Wa kur ca yakak ca haa, wa ca ƴin ca haa, te wa pariɗ ca haa ; ɗisik nu ɗisik ŋ toonohaaca ŋ kur ca, ɓa ɓayeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca nga. A reesa ndeem ɗah, ɓa kiimee ɗe ne ɓa laal lecmiŋ kulɓaakiŋ ɗe dong, te ɓooɓa laalee ɗe jen wireen.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na mbaah caŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Wa raakka mbeh, <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca cohha ŋ ɗiska na Yeesu na ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> puloh Yerusalem. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ɓa hotta ɓi taalube ŋ ɓiŋ Yeesu ñameeɗa na yaah hoolaaɗi, weɗ ne ɓa ɓokteeɗi ca na masuɓ wa ɓa hee ñame. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Te <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci na Yawuut ci jen sah na ñameeɗi muk feeh ɓa ɓohñukohɗi yaah masuɓ, findi mbaahiŋ yakak ci waaɗoha. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ali ɓa puloh ɗiska na toonohse sah, feeh ɓa farsukɗi ɗah, ɓa na ñameeɗi. Ɓa na name taambiɗ in laayiɗ ŋ mbaah ci ɓa lam, mand na findi ɓa na ɓohñohe kaas, na meeme, soƴe, na bool.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Tahha po ɓa meekissa Yeesu ne : « Wa ye tah taalubeeciŋ ɗa na taambɗeeɗi mbaahiŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo, ɓa ñamee na yaah hoolaaɗi ? » <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Naafeehaaci ! Woo kiŋ Kooh wi woosuuɗi Esayi woyee nga ɗu, wa keeh, findi wa fiisohu, ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">“ Cuuɓii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">eɗiŋ ɓa na so cir top ŋ nguɓ ciŋ ɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">keeñ ciŋ ɓa usiɗ to lool.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ñaamkiŋ ɓa na so ɓarang ɓarang.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">Ɓa na jangɗohe in ci ɓo' nakoh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">po mand haa ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">mi yi Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">ñam woo ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esayi 29:13</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Yeesu woyissa ne : « Ɗu na faɗe nakohiŋ Kooh, ɗu taambɗee mbaah ɓo'. »<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />A taalndiɗta a woyissa ne : « Ee, ɗu faɗ nakohiŋ Kooh moɗoɗ daal, ne ɗu taambiɗ mbaahiŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ŋ hot Musaa woyiɗ ne : “ Eɗa yaay ɗu na baab ɗu cir.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Pula 20:12</ref></char></note> ” A woyissiɗ ne “ Ɓo' nu kiimiɗ yaay ɓa wala baab ɓa moɗaaɗi ɗah, a apaah apu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Pula 21:17</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Waaye ɗu, ɗu na jangɗohe ne, ɓo' woo yaay ɓa wala baab ɓa ne : “ Ini ŋ joyee ɗa eɗ, wa <char style="tl">korban</char> ” ɗah (weɗ ne wa wuu Kooh, ɓo' wiiriis minɗi wa njirñiɗkoh), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />teemb ndeem, ɗu hondoh ɗe tumiɗ yaay ɓa wala baab ɓa ali in. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ɗu na heefohe woo kiŋ Kooh ɗaa, sagu taambiɗ mbaahiŋ ɗu ɗu na lamtiɗohe. Te sah, ɗu na name haɓiɗ in wiiriis laayiɗ mand ɗaa. »<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Wa Yeesu ƴut ɓa lof, a ɓeeɗkissa mboolnda, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu jen sikɗukaat to te ɗu inah inii : <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ali in ngaŋ in ci na aase ɓo' minɗi ɗe ɓek hoolaaɗi. Waaye a ini na pulohe ŋ ɓoyi, weɗ na hoolaaɗi'ɗee ɗe. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ɓo' nu raak nof ɗah, kerhaat.] »<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Wa Yeesu kurkoh ŋ mboolnda, a aassa kahna. Taalubeeciŋ ɗe meekissa ɗe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ woo keem. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu sah, ɗu namɗi raak liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ e ? Ɗu inahɗi ne in ci nik ŋ hari te ca aasee ŋ ɓo' jen, ca minɗi ɗe ɓek hoolaaɗi e ? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ca na aaseeɗi ŋ keeñiŋ ɗe, ca na kaɗe ŋ rookiŋ ɗe, ƴut ɗah ca bilafsuku. » Ŋ woo ceem, Yeesu hooliɗta kañam ci jen. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />A woyissa ne : « Ini na pulohe ŋ ɓo' weɗ na ɓekee ɗe hoolaaɗi. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Laam in cii na pulohe ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ɓo' : liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi, faankoh sangohuuɗ, rok, ap ɓo', <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />njaaloo, waaɗ raak in laayiɗ, cakaay, njuucnjaac, nduuɗuk, siis, ɗooɓoh, hotsiɗuk na naandɗuk. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />In ci moɗaaɗiiceem jen na pulohe ŋ ɗooƴ ɓo', ca ɓek ɗe hoolaaɗi. »<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓitiɓ nikaaɗi Yawuut kosiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a kaɗ ɓak caŋ <char style="w">Tiir</char>, a dalla ŋ kahan. A waaɗeeɗi ne ali ɓo' inaha, waaye wa mineeɗi ɗemb.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Wa raakeen ɓitiɓ nga, kuɓkaŋ ɗe ɓitɓa ƴina, a <char style="w">jiini</char> nikee na ɗe. A kerahha ɓooɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, a jaarra hay nga ɗe, a ƴekka ŋ kot ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ɓitɓeem nikeeɗi Yawuut, a nikee <char style="w">Gerek</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gerek </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ maañ ɗah, e ɓooɓi genee Geres, ɓeɗ teeksee Gerek. Kur keem degga kur laayiɗ yaah. Ɓa woyɗukoheeɗa ɓa peɗeem gerek, ɓa tumɗukoheeɗa ɓa mbaah gerek. Kaɗta poo, ɓooɓi degsee yaah ɓeem te ɓa Gerek haa, laayiɗ ɓeendukka nga po ɓa mirndohha tumu Gerek. Ɓitɓii, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓooɓeem. Wi ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> deg kur ceem jen yaah sah, ɓa risee na mbaahi na peɗmiŋ Gerek ci. Te Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char> fiisu ŋ gerek. </char></note>, a ɓaahee Feniis caŋ Siri ; a kiimmba Yeesu ne a aañiɗ ɗe jiinndi amb kuɓkiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Komaakci ñamaat paaɗ po ɓa kap ; wa waas haa ɓuu ci na koɗse teengu kañam kiŋ komaakci. » <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ɓitɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Wa keeh kilifaani, waaye ɓuu ci na koɗse na name ñam ŋ ñamohiiciŋ komaakci, ci na keene. » <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Sagu woo keem, jiinnda faɗiɗ kuɓkiŋ ɗa, fu miniɗ haad. » <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ɓitɓa haadda, a raakka kuɓka faankiɗ moɗoɗ ŋ fiƴaanga, raak jiinnda faɗiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɗik minaaɗi woo baahiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Wa Yeesu kurkoh ɓakaŋ Tiir, a taamb ŋ Sidoon, ne a dokuk ɓakaŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, ngaŋ kur caŋ Dekapool<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapool </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa nikee kur-taah ndaŋkiyaah nangɗukohiɗ. Ɓooɓi genee nga, ɓa nikee Yawuut haa, ɓa taambɗeeɗi waasiŋ Musaa.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />A komuusa ɗik minaaɗi woo baahiɗ. A kiimuusa ne a degaat ɗika yaah, a wiriɗ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yeesu ɓayya ɗe po ɓa ussa mboolnda, a degga ndukun ciŋ ɗe ŋ nof ciŋ ƴaara, a tuhussa, a laalla peɗmiŋ ƴaara. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ƴutta, Yeesu marakka ŋ ɗafki, a iikka iik duu'in, a woosa ne : « <char style="tl">Effata</char> ! » Weɗ ne "Rangsuka !" <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Jaarra nof ciŋ ƴaara rangsukka, peɗmiŋ ɗe toksukka, a jombeeɗa moɗoɗ. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yeesu dennga mboolnda ne ɓa kinaata woo ali ɓo'. Waaye findi a uupee ɓa dengoh ne ɓa kinaata woo, ɓa uupee wa laamtohoh ɗaa.<verse eid="MRK 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ɓooɓa feyseen po ɓa minisɗi, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « In nu a haɓiɗ ɗah, wa in baahiɗ. A tumiɗ po kotii, ɗik ci ɓii kerah, muum ci ɓii jomb. »<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Laayɗaŋ mbuuruuca, wa kanakɗoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ŋ mbeh caam, mboolo laayiɗ cohissa. Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa raakisɗi ñamaah, Yeesu ɓeeɗukka taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />« Ɓooɓii miskiɗ to, neeh kaahay ceɗi cii, ɓii na so, te ɓa raakisɗi ali ñamaah ; <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />ŋ woo ɓa ne ɓa haadaat rook ɓarang ɗah, ɓa keenan ŋ waas. Raakiɗ ɓi puloh ɗisik usiɗ. » <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Taalubeeciŋ ɗe loffa ɗe ne : « Moo ! Ɓo' ɓayohan mbuuruuci min ɓa kap nde ŋ bilaf fii ? » <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />A meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu raak mbuuru hend na ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Mbuuru yasna-kanak. »<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ŋ ineem, Yeesu woosa mboolnda ne ɓa ɓoofaat ŋ kehƴa. A ɓayya mbuuruuca yasna-kanak ca, a corkiɗta Kooh, a nguɗsoheeɗa ca, a eɗeeɗa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ca ne ɓa paysoh ca ; ɓa paysohha ca ɓooɓa. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ɓa nameen raak ɓi cuurund ƴin ndaam, a ɓayya ca, a corkiɗta Kooh nga ca, a woosa ne ɓa paysohaat ca mboolnda. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ɓooɓa ñammba po ɓa kappa ; tasiɗ ca nangɗohuusa, ca nikee dammba yasna-kanak. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ɓooɓa ñamee nikeen ŋ ɓak junni-nikiis (4000). Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne ɓa haadaat. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Jaarra a aassa ŋ gaal na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ɓa kaɗta ɗiska na woyse Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lawiiraŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Wa ɓa ree ndaam, <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca hayya, ɓa markiskeeɗa Yeesu an : Ɓa woosa ɗe ne a haɓɗaat firndeeni puloh ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yeesu fuuppa sagu keeñ riifiɗ, a woosa ne : « Wa ye tah ɓooɓi woti meeksohee firnde ? Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓa eɗsanɗi ali firnde. » <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />A faɗta ɓa ndaam, a aasissa gaal ne ɓa coot ɓaka faahaŋ cookma.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Taalubeeca alkoheen ɓayndoh mbuuru, ɓa raakee mbuuru yino dong ŋ gaala. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeesu dennga ɓa an : « Tumaat moɗoɗ, wortukaat lawiiriŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci na wiŋ Herod. » <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Taalubeeca woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne wa ina ɓa raakɗi mbuuru tah. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />A inahha ina ɓa woye, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu woye ne : “ A ini ɓoo raakɗi mbuuru ? ” Ɗu inhisohɗi te ɗu inahɗi poyi e ? Ɗu raak keeñ ndengiɗ e ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ɗu raakiɗ has. Ɗu minɗi minɗi hot e ? Ɗu raakiɗ nof. Ɗu minɗi minɗi kerah e ? Hanaa ɗu alkoh alkoh <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />wa ŋ nguɗsoh mbuuruuca yatuus ca ŋ paysohha ca mboolnda raakee ƴaar junni-yatuus (5000) ? Tasɗohiica ɗu ɓayndohee nikee pañe riifiɗ hend na ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Pañe ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12). » <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />A woyissa ɓa ne : « Moo wa ŋ nguɗsoh mbuuruuca yasna-kanak ca, ŋ paysohha ca ɓooɓa junni-nikiis (4000) ca nak ? Tasɗohiica ɗu ɓayndohee mbaɗi, ca nikee dammba riifiɗ hend na ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ca nikee dammba yasna-kanak. » <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ris inhaaɗi poyi e ? »<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ fuuliɗ ŋ Betsayda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Wa ɓa kaɗ po Betsayda, a komuusa fuuliɗ, a kiimuusa ne a laal ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yeesu ammba fuulɗa ŋ yaah, a ɓayya ɗe po ɓa pulla kur ka, a tuhussa ŋ has ciŋ ɗe, a degga ɗe yaah ciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu yii hot in e ? » <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ƴaara marakka, a loffa ɗe ne : « Mi yii hot ɓi ɓo', ɓa mand ndo na kidig waaye ɓa na tiinde. » <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />A degissa ɗe yaah ciŋ ɗe ŋ has, ƴaara markissa ; a wirra, a hoteeɗa hooliɗ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Haada kahan fu, kina taamb ŋ ɗooƴ kur ki. »<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe na hultiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe kurkohis ndaam, ɓa kaɗeeɗa ŋ ɓak kur ka na woyse Seesare-Filip, ŋ kur ca ƴin ƴin ca wilee wa. Ŋ waasa, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi na woye ne ñam ɓa ? » <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Raakiɗ ɓi na woye ne a fu <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char>, ɓum woyee ne a fu <char style="w">Ilyas</char>, ɓinooɓi woyee ne fu woosuuɗ wiiriis. » <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />A meeksissa ɓa ne : « Moo ɗu nak ? Ɗu na woye ne ñam ɓa ? » Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « A fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>. » <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yeesu dennga ɓa baahiɗ ne ɓa kinaat woo ali ɓo' ŋ ini kaɗ nga.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Weɗi a camboh ɓa teeɓ ne : « <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> joyiɗ yaaɓ keeh-keeh ŋ yaah ciŋ yakak ci na kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh ciŋ wa, ɓa hey ɗe sange, a apu, te a hulit ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh. » <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />A woyeeɗa woo ceem halang. Piyeer gukka ɗe, ngaseeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yeesu yurhiɗkohha na taalubeeca, a marakka ɓa, a ngassa Piyeer an : « Kurka ndii, kaɗa ŋ finhooso, seytaaniini ! Liiɓohaaɗiŋ ɗa hunɗi na wiŋ Kooh, fu na liiɓe findi ɓo'. »<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Weɗi Yeesu ɓeeɗkoh mboolnda na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu waaɗ nik taalubeeniŋ ngo ɗah, a joyɗi liiɓ haf ce, a degkaat kurwaani aa hee daaƴohse, a ñaakiɗ to. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Laam ɓo' nu waaɗ muciɗ kipes kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a hey wa ñake. Waaye ɓo' nu ñak kipes kiŋ ɗe saguuso na <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ɗah, a heya mucɗe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ɓo' raak adinaani jen na in ci nik nga te a ñak kipes kiŋ ɗe, ineem raakiɗ ɗe winde njiriñ ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ɓo' min romkoh kipes kiŋ ɗe na ye ?<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ɓooɓi woti-woti, ɓa tumoh moɗaaɗi, ɓa topɗi ŋ Kooh po haa njaalo'oh ; ɓo' nu supuk hun na so na woo ciŋ ngo ŋ fikiiɓa ɗah, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey ɗe supke inah ne a hayee ŋ yaki Baabiŋ ɗe yak, a hun na malaakaaci hooliɗ ci ɗah. »<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓi ɓo' ɓii ŋ ndii, ɓa kaananɗi muk te ɓa hotɗi Nguuriŋ-Kooh hayiɗ na hatil. »<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siñaarɗiŋ ndamiŋ Yeesu ŋ ɗafuk tangoora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Wa degga neeh yasna-yino, Yeesu ɓayya Piyeer na Saak na Saaŋ, a kaɗta ɗaaya na ɓa ŋ ɗafuk tango njooliɗ ; ndaam a ɓoƴsukka ŋ fikiiɓa. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Kulɓaacaŋ ɗe melciɗeeɗa melciɗ sagu yaanow ; ali naawoh ŋ kehƴi minɗi yaanwiɗoh kulɓa ɗaa. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Woosuuɗ kanak teeɓukka ɓa, ɓa nikee <char style="w">Ilyas</char> na <char style="w">Musaa</char>, ɓa woyeeɗa na ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, wa baahiɗ ne ɓoo nik ndii. Ɓoo haɓɗaat ɗiip kaahay ; winoori nik wiŋ ɗa, winni nik wiŋ Musaa, wi tas nik wiŋ Ilyas. » <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Piyeer woyiɗ ineem laam a inhisseeɗi in ci a na woye sagu tiita ɓa tiite ; a yi na taalubeeci kanak ci.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Eel hayya muurra ɓa, hooso kerhukka ŋ eela an : « Yii, a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ngo</char> ŋ waaɗ keeh-keeh, sikɗukaat ɗe. » <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Jaarra taalubeeca marakka ini wil ndaam jen, ɓa hotisɗi ali ɓo' na ɓa, ɗal Yeesu kiik ce.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Wa ɓa ruhsee tangoora, Yeesu dennga ɓa an : « Kinaat naandsuk ali ɓo' ini ɗu hot po mbaɗna <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hultan. » <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ɓa ammba woo keem te ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa an : « A waaɗ ye woo ŋ hulit ? » <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah jangɗohoh ciŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> woyee ne Ilyas joyiɗ hayis paaɗ<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:23">Malasi 3:23</ref></char></note> ? » <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' miniɗ woo ne e Ilyas joy hay paaɗ ne a doknoh in ci jen po ca yurah, waaye kinaat alkoh ne, Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci namiɗ woo, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi, ne a joyiɗ yaaɓ laayiɗ te a sangu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:3">Esayi 53:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne Ilyas hayiɗ po ɓooɓi tumiɗ ɗe ini neɓ ɓa findi Fiis ci woyohee wa. »<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu saɓsohiɗ kuɓka na jiinnda muumɗohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa reyeeɗa ŋ taalubeeca ɓinooɓa, ɓa hotta mboolo yakak wiliɗ ɓa, jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa taastiɗoheeɗa na ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mboolnda hotta Yeesu, ɓa feyuusa. Jaarra, ɓa yurahha nga ɗe na mbup, ɓa kañiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />A meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na taastiɗohee ye na ɓa ? » <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ƴaar ŋ mboolnda woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ŋ komee ɗa kuɓkiŋ ngo ƴaari, a <char style="w">jiini</char> muumiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ɗisik nu a amboh ɗe ɗah, a na folee ɗe ŋ ndaam, nguɓiŋ ɗe soñe, a ɗoɓɗohee sis ciŋ ɗe, a jaaɗ. Ŋ kiimiɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗa ne ɓa aañ jiinndi, waaye ɓa minɗaa. » <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓi ɓooɓi woti-woti e ɗu kosaaɗi ; ŋ nikan nik na ɗu, ŋ muñɗee ɗu po kiɗa ? Komaat to ɗe ndii ! » <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ɓa kommba ɗe ɗe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Wa jiinnda hot Yeesu rek, a yoondiɗta kuɓka, yeem keennda, walañkeeɗa ŋ kehƴi, nguɓiŋ ɗe fuureeɗa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yeesu meekissa baabiŋ ɗe ne : « Inii rahas ɗe kiɗa ? » Yeem loffa ɗe ne : « Ina a nikoh komaaki poyi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />In laayiɗ, jiinndi na hiiree ɗe ngaŋ keen ŋ yongkaah mbaa ŋ masuɓ ne a boom ɗe ; kon fu min in nga ɗah, ɓoo miskaat ɗa, fu ɓaatɗoh ɓoo. » <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ min in nga ɗah i ? Raakɗi ini minukɗi ngaŋ ɓoyi kos. » <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Jaarra baab ɓi kuɓka woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ŋ kosiɗ ! Ɓaatɗoh ho ŋ ini tas ŋ kosi ŋ kos ! »<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yeesu hotta ne mboolo laayiɗ wa ɗii ar nangɗukoh, a ngassa jiinnda an : « Ñam woo ne, pula ŋ kuɓkii te kinaa ɗe aasis, fu yi jiinndi na ɗikɗohe, muumɗohe ! » <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Jiinnda pulla kuɓka, a ambsohhaa na sesoh na yoondiɗ ɗe keeh-keeh. Kuɓka mannda na ɓoyi kaan, po laayiɗ woyeeɗa ne a kaaniɗ. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Waaye Yeesu ammba ɗe ŋ yaah ne a kuruk ; a kurukka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Wa Yeesu aas kahna, taalubeeciŋ ɗe ɗaayya na ɗe, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah po ɓoo minɗi aañ jiinnda ? » <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Jiini mand na yeem, a kiim Kooh dong na tahee ɗe coot. »<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyissiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Wa ɓa puloh ndaam, ɓa lahha ŋ ɗooƴ Galile. Yeesu waaɗeeɗi ne wa inhu, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />a nikee jangɗeeɗa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey degse ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓooɓi, ɓa ap ɗe, a hulit ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh. » <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Waaye taalubeeciŋ ɗe inheeɗi ini woo keem tokis te ɓa kaañeeɗi ɗe meekis.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ya ɓa kilifa ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Wa ɓa ree Kapernawum po ɓa nikka ŋ kahna, Yeesu meekissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɗu taastiɗohee ye ŋ waas ? » <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ɓa ɗekka teɗ ; raak ɓa taastiɗohee ya ɓa uup nik kilifaani nga ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />A ɓooffa, a ɓeeɗukka ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu waaɗ nik kilifa ɗah, a teyɗukaat mirndoh, te a teyɗuk nik surgaaniŋ ɓi tas jen. » <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />A ɓayya komaaki a tufkiɗta ɗe ŋ leerooɓa, a morgiɗukka ɗe, a woosa ne : <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />« Ɓo' nu teyɗuk njaanjii saguuso ɗah, a teyɗuk ko. Ɓo' nu teyɗuk ko ɗah, fu teyɗuk ko haa, fu teyɗuk Yi woos so. »<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓoyi sangɗi ɓoo hun na ɓoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Saaŋ woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo hotiɗ ɓo' aañeeɗa jiiniici ŋ tiikiŋ ɗa te a ɓaahɗi nga ɓoo. Tahha po ɓoo woosa ɗe ne a kinaata tumis. » <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kinaat ɗe wa sangoh, laam ali ɓo' minɗi haɓiɗ in feyohiɗ ŋ tiikiŋ ngo po ƴut, jaar a woyee in moɗaaɗi nga so. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ɓo' nu sangɗi ɓoo ɗah, a hun na ɓoo. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ɓo' nu on ɗu pot masuɓ ne ɗu an sagu ɓaahi ɗu ɓaah ŋ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> ɗah, ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓoyeem ñakanɗi aafu nga. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Waaye yaa nu bakaaɗɗukoh yino ŋ komaakci ƴin ci kos so ɓii ɗah, ini hee ngisohe nga ɗe, weɗ ne a toku atoh ɓitiɗ ŋ mbooh, a njafu ŋ cookma.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Penduk bakaaɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Yaahiŋ ɗa waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, nguɗaa, fu tas yaah yino ; laam fu aas ŋ kipes ki na yaah yino, weɗ ngisoh fu kaɗ na yaah ciŋ ɗa kanak ci ŋ yongkaaha heyɗi ƴime. [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Cangind ca na ñame faan ndaam na kaaneeɗi te yongkaaha na ƴimeeɗi." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kotiŋ ɗa waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, nguɗaa ; laam fu aas ŋ kipes ki na kot yino, weɗ ngisoh fu njafu na kot ciŋ ɗa kanak ci ŋ yongkaaha yakka. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Cangind ca na ñame faan ndaam na kaaneeɗi te yongkaaha na ƴimeeɗi." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Te hasiŋ ɗa waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, luhtaa ; laam fu aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh na has yino, weɗ ngisoh fu njafu na has ciŋ ɗa kanak ci ŋ yongkaaha yakka. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Cangind ca na ñame faan ndaam na kaaneeɗi te yongkaaha na ƴimeeɗi.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ɓo' nu nga ɗah, hey jemɗasse na yongkaah. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Meɗa, wa in baahiɗ, waaye meɗa kaɗ po wa jemisɗi ɗah, wa min jemɗohissu na ye ? Raakaat meɗa ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu te ɗu pesohee jam ŋ harmban ɗu. »<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ini Kooh ambsoh, ɓo' kinaata saɓsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yeesu kurkohha ndaam, a kaɗta ɓakaŋ kur caŋ Yudee, na ɓaka winooraŋ Yurdan. Mboolo cohissa nga ɗe, a jangɗisseeɗa ɓa findi a meeɗa tumoh. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca reɓpa, ɓa meekseeɗa ɗe ne ɓa woyɗukoh ɗe woo uupiɗ, an : « Andi ɓo' miniɗ faɗ ɓitiice ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />A loffa ɓa ne : « <char style="w">Musaa</char> eɗ ɗu winde nakoh nga ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A teyɗohiɗ ne, fu miniɗ fiisiɗ ɓitiifu kayti teeɓoh ne fu faɗiɗ ɗe, fu faɗ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Rohƴiɗi 24:1</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />A loffa ɓa ne : « E ndengi ɗu ndeng keeñ weɗ tah Musaa fiisiɗta ɗu nakoheem, <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />waaye ŋ cambohaana, wa Kooh na fere Adina, a fer ɓa ƴaar na ɓitiɓ,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Camba 1:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />weɗ tah ƴaar hey saɓsukohe na yaay na baab, a ŋoɗ ŋ ɓitiice, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ɓa nik faan yino.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Camba 2:24</ref></char></note> Teemb ndeem, ɓa nikisɗi kanak ɓa faan yino kotii. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Kon, ini Kooh ambsoh, ɓo' kinaata saɓsoh. »<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Wa ɓa dokuk kahna, taalubeeciŋ ɗe meekissa ɗe ini kaɗ ŋ ineem. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Yaa nu saɓsukoh na ɓitiice, a tokis ɓitiɓ wiiriis ɗah, a njaaloo njaaloo ŋ harmban ce na ɓitɓa koc. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Te ɓitiɓ nu saɓsukoh na ƴaar ce, a tey ƴaar wiiriis tok ɗe ɗah, a njaaloo njaaloo. »<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na komaakci ƴin ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ɓi ɓo' komeeɗa Yeesu komaaki ƴin ne a laal ɓa, waaye taalubeeciŋ ɗe ngaskeeɗa ɓooɓeem. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yeesu hotta ineem, a ayrukka, a woosa ɓa ne : « Faɗaat komaakci ɓa hay nga so, kinaat ɓa hondoh hay, ɓooɓi mand na ɓa ɓeɗ raak Nguuriŋ-Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓo' nu teyɗukɗi Nguuriŋ-Kooh findi komaaki ƴin ɗah, a aasanɗi nga muk. » <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ƴutta, a gorukka komaakca, a degga ɓa yaah ciŋ ɗe a barke'iɗta ɓa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na heɗ raak-raaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Wa Yeesu coote, ƴaar nuppa ƴekka ŋ fikiice, meekissa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi baahiɗi, ŋ joy ye haɓiɗ po ŋ raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah fu ɓeeɗkohee so baahiɗ ? Ali ɓo' baahɗi, hanaa Kooh dong. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Fu inhiɗ nakoh ci ; an kina ap ɓo', kina njaaloo, kina rok, kina woyiɗ ɓo' ini a tumɗi, kina njuucnjaac, eɗa yaay ɗu na baab ɗu cir.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Pula 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:14">Rohƴiɗi 24:14</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, in ceem jen, mi yii taambiɗ ca, ina ŋ nikoh komaaki poyi. » <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yeesu marakka ɗe, waaɗta ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ ce, a woosa ɗe ne : « Wa in yino dong weɗ fu taskoh. Toona in ci fu raak jen, fu eɗ ca ñakiɗ ci ; fu hey raake alal ŋ Eel ci. Ƴut ɗah, fu hay, fu ñaakiɗ to. » <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ŋ woo keem, fikiiraŋ ƴaara ɓoƴsukohha, a cooteeɗa goyoh na goyoh, a nikee heɗ raak-raak.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ŋ ineem, Yeesu marakka ini wil ɗe, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Heɗ raak-raak aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh wa in ye miskan. » <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Taalubeeciŋ ɗe feyuusa ŋ woo kiŋ ɗe, waaye a woyissa ɓa ne : « Kuɓuuci, aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh yooɓɗi de' ! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ngeelemb taamb ŋ ngul kufic, weɗ uup yooɓ heɗ raak-raak aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. » <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Taalubeeca uuppa nga feyu, ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Kon a ya ɓa min mucɗu ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yeesu marakka ɓa, woosa ne : « Ineem wooñiɗ ɓo' waaye raakɗi ini wooñ Kooh. »<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ŋ ineem Piyeer kooɗta woo ka, a woosa ɗe ne : « Moo ɓoo ɓi faɗ in ciŋ ɓoo jen, ɓoo ñaakiɗta ɗa nak ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓo' nu faɗ kahan, wala taambɗoh ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ, yaay, baab, kuɓu wala yohon saguuso na <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ɗah, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ɓoyeem hey raake, ŋ jamanoonii, ini ree waas teemet ŋ kahan, taambɗoh, yaay, baab, kuɓu, na yohon. Wa hunan na tolfiɗu ŋ kehƴi, waaye, kim a hey raake kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Laayiɗ ŋ ɓi adug woti, ɓeɗ mirndohan, te laayiɗ ŋ ɓi mirndoh woti, ɓeɗ adgan. »<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyissiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe na hultiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Waam, ɓa nikee ŋ waas Yerusalem, Yeesu adugka, ɓa kaɗeeɗa, taalubeeci feyuusa, ɓooɓa hunee na ɓa tiitta. Ŋ ineem a ɓeeɗkissa taalubeeci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) kiik ɓa, a woyeeɗa ɓa ini na hee ɗe rahse. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu hot nga, ɓoo ɓii kaɗ Yerusalem, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hey faɗse ŋ yaah ciŋ kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char>, na jangɗohoh ciŋ wa ; ɓa hey ɗe atte'e ne a apu, ɓa eɗ ɗe ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ɓeem hey ɗe njembte, ɓa tuhus ɗe, ɓa laɓ ɗe leraw, ɓa ap ɗe. Waaye wa raak neeh kaahay ɗah, a hey hulte. »<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiimaŋ kuɓuucaŋ Sebede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Saak na Saaŋ, kuɓuuciŋ Sebede, reɓpa ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo waaɗ ne fu haɓɗiɗ ɓoo ini ɓoo na hee ɗa kiime. » <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu waaɗ ne ŋ haɓɗiɗ ɗu ye ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo waaɗ ne fu nik ŋ ndamiŋ ɗa ɗah, yii ɓoof lah ɗa yaah-ñaahum, yii lah ɗa yaah-sing. » <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Waaye a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inahɗi ini ɗu na kiime. Ɗu miniɗ an ŋ kaasiŋ miskiɗi ŋ anan e ? Andi ɗu miniɗ ɓoktuk ŋ miskiɗi ŋ ɓoktukohan ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ee, ɓoo miniɗa. » A woosa ɓa ne : « Wa keeh ne ɗu hey ane ŋ kaasiŋ miskiɗi ŋ anan te ɗu hey ɓoktuke ŋ miskiɗi ŋ ɓoktukohan ; <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />waaye ini kaɗ ŋ yi lahan ndo yaah-ñaahum na sing, a ñam woyan ɓa haa ; ɓooɓi kooɗkiɗu ɗisik ceem, ɓeɗ lahan ndo nga. »<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Wa taalubeeca ndaŋkiyaah ca ɓinooɓa kerah ineem, ɓa ayrukka Saak na Saaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yeesu ɓeeɗukka ɓa jen, woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inhiɗ ne ɓooɓi ambu kilifa yakak ŋ kur ci na degee deg ɓooɓiŋ ɓa yaah, ɓooɓi uupiɗ hatil uupohee doole. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Waaye wa nikohɗi ɗaa nga ɗu, ɓo' nu waaɗ nik ɓo' yakak nga ɗu ɗah, a teyɗukaat nik surgaaniŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Te ɓo' nu waaɗ adug nga ɗu ɗah, a teyɗukaat nik <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ɓi tas jen. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi sah, hayɗi ne a raak surga, a hay ne a nik surga te a eɗoh kipes kiŋ ɗe ne a tos ɓo' laayiɗ. »<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ fuuliɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe woyeeɗa, kaɗeeɗa po ɓa reesa kur-taaha na woyse Yeriko. Ɓa puleeɗaa, ɓa hunnda na mboolo laayiɗ, raak fuuliɗ yalwaanoh teeku Bartime, kuɓu Time, ɓoofiɗ ŋ mbeeddaana. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Wi a kerah ne a Yeesu yi gen Nasareet na haye, a leehkeeɗa an : « Yeesu setiŋ Dawuuda, ŋ miskaat ɗa ! » <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ɓo' laayiɗ ngaskeeɗa ɗe ne a ɗek. Waaye a uupeeɗa nga leehuk an : « Setiŋ Dawuuda, ŋ miskaat ɗa ! » <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yeesu tufukka, nakohha ɗe ɓeeɗkiɗu. Ɓi ɓo' kaɗta nga ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Ndengɗuka ! Kurka, a nakohiɗ ɗa ɓeeɗku. » <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Jaarra fuulɗa njaffa paltoonaŋ ɗe, a gooñukka, a kaɗta ŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yeesu meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗ ne ŋ haɓɗiɗ ɗa ye ? » A loffa ɗe ne : « <char style="tl">Rabbuuni</char> (jangɗohohiŋ ngo), ŋ waaɗ ne fu tum po has ciŋ ngo min hot ! » <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kaɗa, kosi fu kos wirɗiɗ ɗa. » Jaarra fuulɗa hoteeɗa, a taambiɗta Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Aasaŋ Yeesu Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Wa Yeesu na ɓa hunee na ɗe kaɗ po ɓa heeɗa ree Yerusalem, ŋ ɓak Betfase na Betani, ŋ sero Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca, a woossa kanak ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ŋ kur ki ŋ fikiiɗu wii, ɗu aasee rek ɗah, ɗu hey hote cumbur mbaam tokuuɗ nga, yi ɓo' moosɗi rapoh. Toksaat ɗe, ɗu kom mbo ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ɓo' meekis ɗu ne wa ye tah ɗu toksee ɗe ɗah, lofaat ne : “ A kilifaani etoh ɗe, ƴut ɗah, a hey ɗe dokne ŋ ndii. ” »<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Taalubeeca kaɗta, ɓa raakka cumbraŋ mbaama tokuuɗ ŋ hara, ŋ nguɓu kahan, ɓa tokissa ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Ɓi ɓo' ŋ ɓa nikee ŋ ndaam woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na haɓɗe ye an ? Wa ye tah ɗu toksee cumbriŋ mbaami ? » <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ɓa loffa ɓa findi Yeesu woyohe, ɓa faɗuusa.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wa ɓa hay na cumbra, ɓa raɗta kulɓaacaŋ ɓa ŋ ɗafuk cumbra, Yeesu rappa nga ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ɓo' laayiɗ raɗɗeeɗa ɗe kulɓaacaŋ ɓa ŋ waasa, ɓum raɗeeɗa paangiica ɓa piikohee ŋ yohon ca. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ɓa adgee na ɓa ñaakee nga ɗe woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka woo kii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">« <char style="tl">Hosaana</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Hosaana</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ ɗeɓgaana, wa tokseen ne : "Woti-woti, mucɗa ɓoo." Wa nikee kiim Kooh. Waaye, wa kaɗta po wa nikka woo yakɗoha Kooh.</char></note> !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">Ɓoyi na haye ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi raakaat barke !<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Wa barke'aat,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:10">Nguuriŋ caac ɓoo Dawuuda wi na haye !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="tl">Hosaana</char> ŋ ɗisik ca uup ɗafuk !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabuur 118:26</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Weɗ Yeesu kaɗoh po a reesa Yerusalem, a aassa ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>. Wa a maraka jen po ƴutta, a kurukka, a hunnda na taalubeeci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), ɓa kaɗta Betani, raak Kooh hooɓeeɗa.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Kahan Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, a puleeɗa Betani, a aɗukka. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />A ƴokka ndun kifsiɗ, a kaɗta marka andi a hey raake ini a min ñam nga. Waaye wa a ree, a hotɗi ali in nga ɗal saaf ca. Wa nikeeɗi ŋ jamanooni ndun ci na rimohe. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />A woosa nduna ne : « Ali ɓo' ñamissanɗi rim ciŋ ɗa ! » Taalubeeciŋ ɗe kerheeɗa nga.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Wa ɓa ree Yerusalem, Yeesu aassa ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh, a aañeeɗa toonoh ca na romoh ca nikee nga. A foleeɗa taaɓul caŋ ɓoƴsoh kopor ca na ɓoofohaacaŋ toonoh banuut ca. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />A faɗeeɗi ali ɓo' ne a taamb na bagaas ŋ ɗooƴ Kahnaŋ Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />A jangɗeeɗa ɓooɓa an : « A inii weɗ woyu ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci haa e ? Ne : “ Kahan ndo teeksan kahan kiimoha wuu cuuɓ ci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Toonoh ca, na ɓooɓa meeɗ taamb na bagaas caŋ ɓa ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh, ɓa meeɗ nik ŋ ɗiska ɓi nikɗi Yawuut topɗasse.</char></note> jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esayi 56:7</ref></char></note> ” Waaye ɗu tumiɗa ɗembohaaniŋ rokoh ci. »<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ŋ ineem kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh caŋ wa kerahha Yeesu, ɓa waakeeɗa findi ɓa hee ɗe apohe. Ɓa neƴƴoheen ɗe sagu aasa jangɗohiŋ ɗe aasee mboolnda.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Wa niina ree, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe pulla Yerusalem.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nduna Yeesu yonjee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina na ɓaaɓa, ɓa dokkeeɗa po ɓa teembeeɗa ŋ nduna, ɓa hottaa suyiɗ po ŋ niir ca. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Piyeer naandsukka ina raake, a woosa Yeesu ne : « Jangɗohohi, marka ! Nduni fu yonjee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yonj </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: kiim in moɗaaɗi ne wa raak. </char></note> suyiɗ kong ! » <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Kosaat Kooh, <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓo' nu woo tangoorii ne : “ Kurka ndii, njafka ŋ cookma ” te a raakɗi liiɓ kanak nga, waaye a kos ne ini a woo hey raake ɗah, Kooh hey ɗe wa tumɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Weɗ tah mi na woyee ɗu ne, in nu ɗu kiimee Kooh ɗah, kosaat ne ɗu rahsiɗa po ƴutiɗ, Kooh hey ɗu wa tumɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Fu kiimee Kooh te raak, fu ambɗiɗ morom fu in ɗah, ɗaasa ɗe, Baabiŋ ɗu, yi ŋ Eel ci nam ɗa ɗaas. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Waaye ɗu ɗaasohɗi ɗah, Baabiŋ ɗu, yi ŋ ɗafki, ɗaasanɗi ɗu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note> »<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ɓa tufkiɗ Yeesu ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe dokkis Yerusalem, a tiindsukeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh, kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na jangɗohoh caŋ wa na yakak ca, hayya nga ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « In ci fu na haɓɗe, fu gaƴuk nde po fu kaannja ca haɓiɗ, wala a ya ɓa tufkiɗ ɗa ne fu haɓiɗ ca ? » <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Maa hee ɗu meekse in yino dong, lofaat to, ŋ woo ɗu ini tufkiɗ to po ŋ haɓɗee in cii. » <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ya ɓa tuuƴee <char style="w">Yahya</char> ne a ɓoktoh, a Kooh wala ɓi ɓo' ? Lofaat to ! » <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Waaye ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɓoo woo ɗe ne Kooh a yi woos Yahya ɗah, a na hee woye ne : “ Wa ye tah ɗu kosɗi ɗe ? ” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Te ɓoo namɗi kaañ woo ne wa puloh ŋ ɓooɓi. » Ɓa neƴƴoheen ɓooɓa laam mboolnda jen ambeen ne, Yahya nikee woosuuɗ keeh-keeh. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ɓa loffa Yeesu ne : « Ɓoo inahɗi. » A woosa ɓa ne : « Kon ŋ namanɗi ɗu woo ini tufkiɗ to po ŋ haɓɗee in cii. »<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ guuroh ca añaandiɗ ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yeesu woyeeɗa na kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca ŋ andiin an : « A nikee ƴaar, a yippa yohon reseñ, a ɗinngaa po wa willa. A acca nung pooƴoha masmiŋ reseñi nga, a haɓiɗta paraang niiɗohaa wa. Ƴutta, a hanndaa deg ŋ yaah ɓi guuroh reseñ ne wa ruund ɗah ɓa paysoh ; a ɓaaɓpa.<verse eid="MRK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Wi yohni ruund, a tuuƴca <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ guuroh ci ne a rahas ɓakiŋ ɗe ŋ reseñi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Guuroh ca ammba ñaama, ɓa laɓpa ɗe, ɓa aannja ɗe yaah ɓarang. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />A tuuƴissa ñaam wiiriis nga ɓa, ɓa laɓpa ñaama ŋ haf, ɓa ɓassohha ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />A tuuƴissa ya kaahayɗoh, ɓa appa ɗe. Ɓa laɓpa ñaam laayiɗ ɓi fu inah ne a namee ɓa nam tuuƴ, ɓa appa ɓum.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />A tasɗee kuɓkiŋ ɗe a keeñkoh dong. Ŋ mirndaani, a woossa ɗe nga ɓa, a woosa ŋ haf ce ne : “ Ɓa hey supke kuɓkiŋ ngo. ” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Waaye wi pangkoh ci hot ɗe, ɓa woosa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : “ Lamohiŋ yohni a yi ! Hayaat ɓoo ap ɗe, lamaahi nik wiŋ ɓoo kotii. ” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ɓa ammba ɗe, ɓa appa ɗe, ɓa mbetta ɗe ŋ finho yohni. »<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yeesu woosa ne : « Moo, ɗu liiɓ ne heɗ yohniŋ reseñi tuman na ? A hey haye, a ap guuroh ci, a deg yohni ŋ yaah ɓi ɓo' wiiriis. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Hanaa ɗu jangɗi ini Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo wii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">“ Atoh fi taɓahoh ci mbete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">mirndohiɗ nik atoh fi amb taɓahi.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ineem puloh ŋ Heɗ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">wa in feyohiɗ ŋ has ciŋ ɓoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sabuur 118:22-23</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ŋ ineem, kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca inheen ne Yeesu woyee na ɓa ŋ andiina, ɓa waakeeɗa findi ɓaa hee ɗe ambohe. Waaye ɓa neƴƴoheen mboolnda, tahha po ɓa faɗta ɗe, ɓa cootta.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lempooniŋ buur Sesaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ŋ finho ineem, ɓa tuuƴca ɓi <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> na ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ langtoh caŋ Herod ne ɓa kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woyɗukoh ɗe woo ki min ɗe ɓek. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ɓeem hayya woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo inhiɗ ne fu woyoh keeh te fu nupɗi ali ɓo' ; laam, fu na markeeɗi ŋ yaki ɓoyi yak, waaye fu na jangɗohe waasiŋ Kooh ŋ keeh ; woya ɓoo andi wa waas ne Sesaar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sesaar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: buur nu tufkiɗasseen Rom ɗah, a meeɗ ɓay tiiki Sesaar, waaye yaa nu nga ɓa raakeen tiikiŋ ɗe haf ce.</char></note>, buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, wirndasse lempo wala ? Ɓoo wirind, wala ɓoo wirnduu ? »<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Waaye Yeesu inahha ne woo ciŋ ɓa keeh nga ɓa haa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu waaɗee so ɓek ? Komaat to hanjar <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> ndii ŋ marak. » <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ɓa eɗta ɗe hanjar yino, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Ya ɓa raak nataalii, na tiiki nik nga ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A Sesaar. » <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Eɗaat Sesaar ini Sesaar raak, te ɗu eɗ Kooh ini Kooh raak. » Ɓa feyuusa keeh-keeh nga ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci na ini kaɗ ŋ hulti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Ŋ ineem, ɓooɓi na woyse <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char> hayya ŋ Yeesu. Ɓeɗ ɓi na woye ne kaaniɗ ci hultanɗi. Ɓa hayya ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />« Jangɗohohi, nakohii weɗ <char style="w">Musaa</char> fiisiɗ ɓoo : “ Ƴaar kaan te a raakɗi kuɓu na ɓitiice ɗah, a taambɗoh ce joy tok ɓitɓi, a raakiɗ ƴaari kaanɗi kuɓu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Rohƴiɗi 25:5-6</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Waaye wa raakeen taambɗoh yasna-kanak. Saawi tokka ɓitiɓ, a faɗɗi kuɓu a kaannda. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Yi taamb nga ɗe lammba ɓitɓa, a nammba kaan raakaaɗi kuɓu, yi kaahayɗoh nammba tum ɗaa. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ɓa kaɗeeɗa po yasna-kanak ci jen kaannda te ali ɓo' raakɗi kuɓu nga ɓa ; ƴutta, ɓitɓa nammba kaan. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ɓooɓi hulit ɗah, a nikan ɓiti ya ɓa nga ɓa ? Laam, ɓeɗ ɓi yasna-kanak ci jen ɓa tokiɗ ɗe findi ɓitiɓ ! »<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ini muuƴiɗ ɗu, weɗ ne, ɗu inahɗi ini Fiis ci woo, ɗu inahɗi hatiliŋ Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ɓooɓi hulit ɗah, ƴaar ci heyɗi toke ɓitiɓ, ɓitiɓ ci heyɗi tokse, ɓa mandan na malaakaaciŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kakaan ki na hultiŋ ɓooɓi, andi ɗu jangɗi ŋ teerndiŋ Musaa, ŋ ɗiski na woye ŋ kidga ƴina jaale ? Ŋ ndeem, Kooh woo ɗe ne : “ Ñam Koohiŋ Ibrahiima, Isaahha, na Yaŋhooɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Pula 3:6</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Kooh, a Koohiŋ kaaniɗ ci haa, a Koohiŋ pesiɗ ci. Muuƴi ɗu muuƴ yakiɗ. »<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakohi uup yak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ƴaar ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> kerahha woo caŋ ɓa. A hotta ne, findi Yeesu lofoh ƴaaɓa, wa ɗaa. A reɓpa, a meekissa ɗe ne : « A winde nakoh uupiɗ etoh ŋ nakoh ci jen ? » <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Wii weɗ nakohi uupiɗ etoh : “ Sikɗuka Israayel, Kooh Heɗ ɓoo a yi dong Heɗi ! <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Waaɗa Heɗ ɓoo, yi Koohiŋ ɗa, na keeñiŋ ɗa jen, na ruuhiŋ ɗa jen, na liiɓiŋ ɗa jen, na hatiliŋ ɗa jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Rohƴiɗi 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Wii taammba nga : “ Waaɗa morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref></char></note> ” Raakɗi nakohi uup nakoh cii. »<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « Ee Jangɗohohi, fu woo keeh ne a Kooh yino dong raak, wiiriis raakɗi ɗal a yi ; <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />te fu waaɗ ɗe na keeñiŋ ɗa jen, na liiɓiŋ ɗa jen, na hatiliŋ ɗa jen, fu nam waaɗ morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu ɗah, weɗ uupiɗ njiriñ fu <char style="w" lemma="hoomiɗ">hoomɗiɗ</char> Kooh ɗoopaat, wala <char style="w">seeƴuk</char> nu min nik ɗah. » <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Jaarra Yeesu hotta ne a lofiɗ na liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu usɗi Nguuriŋ-Kooh. » Ŋ finho ineem, ali ɓo' kaañisɗi ɗe meekis ne a markisuk ɗe.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucɗohi Gapohse na Dawuuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yeesu nikee jangɗoheeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> poyi. Ngaŋ jangɗoheem a meeksohha ne : « Jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi minoh woo na ne : “ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, a setiŋ Dawuuda ? ” <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Te ŋ hot <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, woyɗukohiɗ Dawuuda inii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">“ Heɗ ɓoo woyiɗ Heɗ to ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Ɓoofa ŋ ñaahmiŋ ngo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">po mbaɗna ŋ folan ɓi sang ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">fu tum ɓa degoha kot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabuur 110:1</ref></char></note>’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dawuuda ŋ haf ce a yi ɓeeɗkoh Mucɗohi Gapohse Heɗ ce, kon a min na nikohis setiŋ ɗe ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Wa raak mboolo laayiɗ nga sikɗukeeɗa Yeesu, ɓa neɓuusa. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />A woyeeɗa ɓa ŋ jangɗohaŋ ɗe ne : « Wortukaat mand na jangɗohoh ciŋ waasiŋ Musaa, ini neɓ ɓa weɗ ne ɓa ɓekuk kulɓa yakiɗ ɓa tiindsuke. Te ɓa kañɗassee yaah kanak ŋ ɗisik ci na toonohse ŋ kur. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Ɓa nam waaɗ ne, ɓa nikan ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ngaŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci, te ɓa ɓeeɗku kañam yakak ɗah, ɓa na waaɗe ɓoof ŋ ɗisik ci uup eɗu cir. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ɓeɗ na ñame raakuuɗiŋ ɓitiɓ ci ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan po kahan ciŋ ɓa sah ; te ɓa kiimee Kooh ɗah, wa minuu reeh, ɓa waakee hotaat to. Ambaat ne a mbugaliŋ ɓa uupan misik. »<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eɗohaŋ ɓitɓa ñakɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Wa Yeesu ƴut, a ɓooffa, a yurhiɗkohha na ɗiska na ɓekohse kopora ŋ Kahan Kooh, a markeeɗa mboolnda, ɓa ɓekeeɗa kopor nga, a hotta ɓi heɗ alal laayiɗ ɓekeeɗa kopor keeh-keeh nga. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />A nammba hot ɓitiɓ ñakiɗ, yi ƴaar ce kaan, ɓekiɗ nga hanjar kanak ƴin findi pistiriñ. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yeesu ɓeeɗukka taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam woo ɗu wa te wa keeh, ini ɓitɓi ñakɗii eɗoh, weɗ uup ciŋ ɓinooɓi jen. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Laam findi ɓa hend jen, ɓa eɗoh ini ɓa etohɗi ŋ raak-raakiŋ ɓa, waaye a yi, ŋ ñaki a ñak a eɗoh ini a raakee pesoha jen. »<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Sañuukaŋ Yerusalem na hayiŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />A Yeesu nik ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> po a puleeɗa, ƴaar ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, marka taɓah ci findi ca yakoh na atoh ci ca taɓahohu findi ca moɗoh ! » <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Taɓah ci yakak ci fu na hote cii, ali atoh tasanɗi ŋ ɗafuk atoh ŋ ndii, ca jen ca hey yahrohse. »<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ŋ finho woo keem, a kaɗta, a ɓooffa ŋ ɗafuk Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca, a yurhiɗkohha na Kahnaŋ Kooh. Piyeer na Saak na Saaŋ na Andare ɗaayya na ɗe, meekissa ɗe ne : <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />« Woya ɓoo jamanooni in ceem na hee raakohe na ini na hee teeɓohe ne in ceem jen ca ɗi heeɗa raake. »<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />A kooɗta woo ki, a lofeeɗa ɓa an : « Wortukaat, ali ɓo' kinaat ɗu muuƴiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ɓo' laayiɗ hey haye, ɓa kooɗ tiikiŋ ngo, ɓa woyee ne ɓeɗ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> te ɓa hey muuƴɗe ɓo' laayiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kaɗ po ɗu kerhoot ɓi hiñoh yakak wala ɗu kerah yegɗoh ci na woye ŋ hiñoh ɗah, kinaat neƴƴoh, in ceem joy joy raak waaye wa nikanɗi ne a Adina na reehe ŋ ɗiski ɗiski. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Cum ɗah, kur hey hiñohe na kur morom wa, buur hey hiñohe na buur morom ce. Kehƴi hey yoondɗuke ŋ ɓi ɗisik te aɗ raak ŋ ɓi ɗisik. Wa nikohan ɗaa. Ca nikan cambiŋ miskiɗ ci findi ɓitɓi na hee ɓasle.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Waaye ɗu, kurkaat ŋ haf ɗu, laam, ɗu hey ambse, ɗu ɓayu ŋ ngelohaaci, ɗu hey laɓse ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci te ɗu hey ɓayse ŋ fiki ɓi goornoor na ɓi buur saguuso. Ineem hey tahe po ɗu min ndo seede ŋ fikiiɓa. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" /><char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> weɗ joy katohu paaɗ ŋ cuuɓ ci jen. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ɓa ɓayee ɗu kaso ɗah, kinaat feyu ŋ ini ɗu woyan. Woyaat ini hayɗohan ɗu ŋ saasi saasi ; e ɗu woyan haa, waaye a <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Ɓo' hey ambɗuke taambɗoh ce ne a apu, baabu hey ambɗuke kuɓkiŋ ɗe ne a apu, ɓi komaaki hey nike sangiɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi rim ɓa, ɓa apɗuk ɓa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Ɓooɓi jen hey ɗu sange saguuso. Waaye ɓoyi na hee ndengɗuke muñ po ŋ reehɗohaana, hey mucɗasse.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Kaɗ po ɗu hot ini araamiɗi na yahrohe tufkiɗ ŋ ɗiski a joyɗi nik ɗah,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:31">Dañeel 11:31</ref></char></note> - Fu yi na jange Fiis cii, inha ! - ɓooɓi wa raakan ŋ Yudee, ɓa saandohaat ŋ tangooca. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ɓoyi wa raakan ŋ ɗafuk teeraasiŋ ɗe, a ruhsee ɗah, a kinaat aas ŋ ɗooƴ kahan ce ne a hee ɓaye in nga. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Te ɓoyi wa raakan ŋ yohon ca, a kinaat gurid ne a hee ɓaye kulɓaakiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Mas ɓitiɓ ci na hee nike rook ŋ jamanooneem na ɓapɗoh ci ! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Kiimaat Kooh po wa nikuu ŋ jamanooniŋ soosi. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Laam ŋ mbeh ceem ɓooɓi hey raake miskiɗ. Miskiɗ mand ɗaa moosɗi raakoh ina Kooh feroh Adina poyi te wa raakissanɗi. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Te Heɗ ɓoo haawseeɗi mbeh ceem ɗah, ali kiñin heeɗi muce ; waaye a haawsiɗ ca sagu ɓooɓi a tan.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ŋ jamanoonaam ɓo' woo ɗu ne Mucɗohi Gapohse yii ŋ ndii wala ŋ nden ɗah, kinaat ɗe kos. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Laam ɓi ɓo' hey haye ɓa tum haf ɓa Mucɗohi Gapohse wala woosuuɗ te ɓa yino nga ca haa, ɓa haɓɗee firnde na keemaan ne ɓa muuƴiɗ ɓooɓi po ɓi Kooh tan sah ne wa mineen nik ɗah. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Waaye ɗu nak, wortukaat ! Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu ca jen nak, bala ca hayan.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ŋ jamanooneem, ŋ finho mbeh ci miskiɗ ceem, nohi ñuus, caɓni ƴim, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />hor ci keen, hatil ci nik ŋ eel ci yoondɗu, <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />teemb ndeem, ɓooɓi hey hote <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayee ŋ eel,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dañeel 7:13</ref> </char></note> a hun na hatil laayiɗ na ndam. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />A hey woose malaakaaci, a cohɗoh ɓooɓi a tan ɓak po ɓak ŋ adinaani jen po ɗiska eel ci top.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Inhaat ini nduni jangɗoh : Kaɗ po naak ciŋ wa hiƴ, wa camb kifis ɗah, ɗu na jaare inah ne rehi usisɗi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Wa mand ɗaa, ɗu nam hot in ceem ɗah, inhaat ne wa usisɗi, weɗi ŋ nguɓu kahni. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓooɓiŋ adinaani woti kurkohanɗi nga jen te in ceem jen raakɗi. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Eel ci na kehƴi hey coote, waaye woo ciŋ ngo moosanɗi cootoh.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Ini kaɗ ŋ mbehi, wala wahtuuni in ceem na hee raakohe, ali ɓo' inahɗaa. E malaakaaciŋ Eel ci haa, a <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> haa, a Baabi a yi inaha. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Kon wortukaat, kinaat neeh, ɗu inahɗi andi wa nikan kiɗa. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Wa mand na ƴaari na ɓaaɓe, a dengkoh <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗe kahni, yaa nu nga ɗah a tufkiɗ ɗe, a woo ɗe ini a hee haɓɗe, a woo yi nik ŋ yahndeeri ne a niiɗaat. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kon kinaat neeh, ɗu inahɗi andi heɗ kahni hayan kiɗa, ndaa wa nikan noh niiniɗ, wala na wek, wala na wiisaaɗi, wala daaɓdaaɓ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mbaa wortukaat po a hey jalañ ɗah, a raakuu ɗu neehe.<verse eid="MRK 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ini mi na woyee ɗu, maa woyee wa ɓooɓi jen : Kinaat neeh ! »<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca waaɗiɗ ap Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Waam, e neeh kanak tasee ne feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakiŋ</char></char> Yawuut ci na wiŋ mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir ci ree.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Pula 12:1-27</ref></char></note> Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh caŋ wa waakeeɗa findi ɓa ambohan Yeesu te ɓo' yeguu, ne ɓa apɗuk ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ɓa woyee ne wa joyɗi nik ŋ ɗooƴ feet ci, ɓa sangee ne ɗuuɗ raak ŋ ɗooƴ ɓooɓa.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓitiɓ yiifiɗ laackoloñ ŋ hafiŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yeesu nikee ŋ kahan Simong Gaanaana, ŋ Betani. Ɗekka po ɓo' ɓitiɓ aassa, a raakka ɗe ñameeɗa, a ɓayee <char style="tl">buteel</char> <char style="tl">albaatar</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">albaatar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa atoh moɗiɗ, yooɓiɗ pestu, wa na etohse haɓɗoha tumoha laackoloñ.</char></note> riifiɗ na laackoloñ haɓɗohuuɗ <char style="tl">narda</char> koceet, candoomaŋ wa ɗoɓeen lool. A poɓiɗta lecmiŋ wa, a yiiffa Yeesu wa ŋ haf. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ɗiska hotta ineem, ɓa lahtukeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Wa ye tah laackoloñi yahrohse ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Wa mineen toonohu ini uup <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> teemet-kaahay (300), ñakiɗ ci eɗu kopori. » Ŋ ineem ɓa ngaskeeɗa ɓitɓa. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Waaye Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Faɗaat ɗe, wa ye tah ɗu yaaɓɗee ɗe ? A tumiɗ to in baahiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ñakiɗ ci genan gen na ɗu ; ɗu miniɗ ɓa tumiɗ in baahiɗ ŋ jamano nu ɗu waaɗoha ɗah. Waaye mi, ŋ genanɗi na ɗu. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Te ɓitɓii haɓiɗ ini a min, a eeñɗiɗ faaniŋ ngo po ƴutiɗ bala ɓekuukiŋ wa ŋ ruy-ruy. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗisik nu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> woyu ŋ adinaani jen ɗah, ini a haɓiɗ hey woyse nga, naandsukohaa ɗe. »<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudaa woriɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yudaa Iskaryot, yino ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), kaɗta ŋ kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa, ne a min ɓa eɗind Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ɓa sikɗukka ɗe, ɓa summba nga lool ! Ɓa gappa ɗe eɗ kopor. Ŋ ineem, Yudaa waakeeɗa findi a joy ɗe eɗoh ɓi sang ɗe moɗoɗ.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗiski Yeesu haɓɗohan <char style="tl">Paaki</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ŋ mbehi koc ŋ feetiŋ Mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir ci wi mbaaliŋ <char style="tl">Paaki</char> na hoosohse, taalubeeciŋ Yeesu meekissa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu waaɗ ne ɓoo kaɗan ɗa haɓɗohɗa kañam kiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char> nde ? » <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yeesu tuuƴca kanak nga ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat Yerusalem, ɗu hey cohe na ƴaar ɓayiɗ meeme masuɓ, ñaakɗaat ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Woyaat heɗ kahna a aasohan ne : “ Jangɗohohi woo ne, wa nde ɗiski a joy ñamoh mbaaliŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char>, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ? ” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />A hey ɗu teeɓe tuuƴ angiɗ ŋ ɗafuk kahna, na in ci joy nik nga, ɗu kooɗkiɗohɗan ɓoo kañam ki ndaam. » <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Taalubeeca kaɗta Yerusalem ; wa ɓa ree, ɓa raakohha in ceem ɗaa findi Yeesu woyohee ɓa, ɓa kooɗkiɗta kañam kaŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char>.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kañam kiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Wa niina ree, Yeesu na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) hayya. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Wa ɓa ɓoof ɓa ñameeɗa, a woosa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗu ɓi na ñame na so ɓii, yino nga ɗu hey yo eɗndohe ŋ ɓi sang ngo. » <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ɓa soossa, yaa nu nga woosa ɗe ne : « Mbaar a mi haa ? » <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Yino ŋ ɗu ɓi ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) na ɓeke yaah na so ŋ booli. » <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />A degga nga ne : « Wa keeh ne <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hey kurke nga findi Fiis ci woyoha nga ɗe, waaye mas ɓoyi na hee ɗe eɗndohe ŋ ɓi sang ɗe, ini ngisohee ŋ ɓoyeem weɗ ne a rimkuu. »<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ɓa ñameeɗa, Yeesu ɓayya mbuuru, a corkiɗta Kooh, a poɓiɗtaa, a eɗta ɓa wa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓayaat, wii wa faaniŋ ngo. » <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ƴutta, a ɓayya kaas tumiɗ, a corkiɗta Kooh, a eɗta ɓa wa, ɓa jen ɓa annda nga. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Wii, wa ñif miŋ ngo aamu wuu ɓi laayiɗ, ñif mi ndengiɗ Ambtiɗohi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ŋ heyɗi anisse masuɓ reseñ po mbaɗna ŋ anissan wi asi, ŋ Nguuraŋ Kooh. »<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu yegɗohiɗ kafndukiŋ taalubeeci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Wa ɓa ƴut ŋ kañam ka po ɓa ƴeekka ƴeek ciŋ <char style="tl">Sabuur</char>, ci hun na feeti, ɓa pulla, ɓa kaɗeeɗa Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Wa fiisuuɗ ne : “ Ŋ hey laɓe niiɗohi, mbaal ci pasarkoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sakriya 13:7</ref></char></note> ” Kon inhaat ne ɗu jen ɗu hey kafnduke. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Waaye, ŋ hultiɗu po ƴut ɗah, ŋ hey ɗu adge Galile. » <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Ali ɓooɓi jen kafnduk, ŋ kafndukanɗi. » <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗa wa te wa keeh, woti ŋ ɗooƴ weki, bala siiki leehkan waas kanak ɗah, fu hey yo taaske waas kaahay. » <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Waaye Piyeer ɓaatta ndengɗuk ŋ woo ka an : « Ali nik ne ŋ kaanan kaan na ɗa sah, ŋ taaskanɗi ɗa. » Ɓa jen ɓa nammba woo ɗaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiim caŋ Yeesu ŋ Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Wa ɓa ree ngaŋ ɗiska na woyse Getsemane, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoofaat ndii, ŋ kaɗ kiima Kooh. » <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />A kooɗta Piyeer na Saak na Saaŋ, a hunnda na ɓa. A cammba yeg neƴƴoh na jaahiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ce. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗiski wa nik ndii faaniŋ ngo goy goy po mi yii heeɗa kaane, tasaat ndii ɗu irin. » <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />A faɗta ɓa ndaam, a kaɗta ƴissuut ŋ fikiiɓa, a ƴekka ŋ kehƴi, a kiimeeɗa Kooh ne wahtuuniŋ miskiɗi ɗalaat ɗe, ne wa min nik ɗah. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />A woosa ne : « <char style="tl">Abba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Abba</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ "baab", ŋ peɗmaŋ Yawuut ca ɗeɓgaan.</char></note>, Baab, raakɗi ini wooñ ɗa, usɗiɗ to kaasiŋ miskiɗii. Waaye wa kinaat nikoh findi ŋ waaɗoh, waaye waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗa weɗ raakaat. »<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Wi a dokuk, a raakka ɓa neeheeɗa, a woosa Piyeer ne : « Simong, fu yi neeh de' ! Fu minɗi sah irin ini ree wahtu ! » <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Kinaat neeh, kiimaat Kooh a ndengiɗ ɗu po ɗu keenuu ŋ fiir. Waaɗ-waaɗi wii nga waaye faan ci raakɗi hatil. » <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />A kaɗissa, a woyeeɗa in ci a woyee ŋ kiimaŋ ɗe koc.<verse eid="MRK 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Wa a dokkis nga ɓa, a raakissa ɓa neeheeɗa, raak ɓa pani'uuɗ po has ciŋ ɓa aaykohha. Ɓa raakeeɗi lofaah ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />A kaɗissa, a hayissa waasi kaahayɗoh, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓii neeh, ɗu ɓii iɗsiɗuk ! Wa doyiɗ, wahtuuni reyiɗ ! Weɗɗi, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi faɗuuɗ ŋ yaah ciŋ bakaaɗoh ci ! <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Kurkaat ɓoo kaɗ ! Markaat, yi joy yo eɗndoh a yi ! »<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ambuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Wa Yeesu na woye, jaarra, Yudaa, yi ɓaah ŋ ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), reesa na mboolo ɓayiɗ ɓi ndooɗ na ɓi ndang. Ɓa puloh ŋ kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na jangɗohoh caŋ wa na yakak ca. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Raak Yudaa woyiɗ ɓa ne : « Ɓoyi maa hee foone inhaat ne a yi ; ambaat ɗe po a ndeng, ɗu ɓay ɗe ɗaa. » <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />A reyeeɗa rek, a reɓpa ŋ Yeesu, a woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi ! » A foonnda ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Jaarra ɓa ammba Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ƴaar ɓaah ŋ ɓa nikee ŋ ndaam fuurra ndang, ƴoɓpa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ ñaam caŋ seeƴkiɗoha yakka, a carissa nofaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu hayiɗ na ndooɗ na ndang findi taamboh rok ne ɗu amb mbo. <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Moona Kooh-nu-wiis, ŋ nikee ŋ harmban ɗu ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, ŋ jangɗoheeɗa, te ɗu ambɗi so. Waaye in cii jen raakiɗ ne ini Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo raak. »<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ŋ ineem, taalubeeciŋ ɗe jen faɗta ɗe, ɓa saandohha. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Raakiɗ kuɓka fiira ñaakɗee ɗe, a lipkee na uuf dong. A ambseeɗa, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />a faɗta lipaŋ ɗe nga, a saandohha faan ɓarang.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ yaah atte'oh ca yakak ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ɓa ɓayoh Yeesu ɗaa ŋ kahan <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char> yakka. Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa jen na jangɗohoh caŋ wa na yakak ca cohee ŋ ɗiska. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Piyeer nikee ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe usiɗ ŋ finhoora po findi a reyoh kahan seeƴkiɗoha yakka, a ɓooffa na surgaaca ŋ leero kahna, ɓa yohnukeeɗa. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na ɓooɓa ɓinooɓa ɓaah ŋ <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel">saangnaŋ yakak caŋ Israayel</char> jen waakeeɗa seede ne ɓa raak ini tah ɓa min apɗuk Yeesu, waaye ɓa hotɗi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Laayiɗ leyɗoheeɗa ɗe waaye woo caŋ ɓa huneeɗi. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Raakka ɓa kuruk leyɗoheeɗa ɗe ne <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />ɓa kerhootiɗ ɗe a woosa ne : « Ŋ hey yahrohe Kahniŋ Kooh wi yaah ɓo' haɓiɗ wii. Ƴut ɗah, ngaŋ neeh kaahay, ŋ taɓah wiiriis wi yaah ɓo' haɓɗanɗi. » <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Po ŋ ineem sah, woo caŋ ɓa huneeɗi.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Teemb ndeem, seeƴkiɗoha yakka tufukka ŋ fiki mboolnda jen, a meekissa Yeesu ne : « Fu heyɗi lofe ali in ŋ in ci ɓooɓi na yambee ɗa e ? » <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Waaye Yeesu ɗekka teɗ, lofɗi ali in. Seeƴkiɗoha yakka meeksissa ɗe an : « Andi a fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, kuɓkiŋ Heɗ barkeeni ? » <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ñam nik, te ɗu hey hote Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ɓoofiɗ ŋ ñaahmiŋ Heɗ hatili, te ɗu hey ɗe hote hayee ŋ eel.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabuur 110:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dañeel 7:13</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Seeƴkiɗoha yakka faarra kulɓaaciŋ ɗe, a yi ŋ haf ce, ne a teeɓoh ne wa woo uupiɗ. A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo etohis seede ye ? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />A ɗu kerhoota, a ɗaliɗ Kooh, a joy ye tumu ? » Ɓa jen ɓa hunnda ɓa woosa ne : « A apaah apu <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lewiici 24:16</ref></char></note>! » <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Raakka ɓi tuhsee ɗe, ɓa muurra has ciŋ ɗe na daah, ɓa laɓeeɗa ɗe kumah, ɓa woyeeɗa ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu woosuuɗ ɗah, woya ɓoyi laɓ ɗa ! » Surgaaca taambukka ɗe na paɗ.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer taaskiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Waam, raak Piyeer ŋ kehƴi, ŋ leero kahna, komaaki cafaƴ reesa, a ɓaahee ŋ ñaam caŋ seeƴkiɗoha yakka. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />A hotta Piyeer yohnukeeɗa, a feerukka ɗe baahiɗ, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu namee nik na ƴaariŋ Nasareet ci, Yeesu. » <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Waaye Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hotɗi ini fu waaɗ woo te ŋ inahɗaa. » A kurkohha ndaam, a kaɗta nguɓu kahna. [Siika leehukka.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ɓoya ɓitɓa hotissa ɗe, a woyisseeɗa ɓooɓa nikee nga ne : « Ƴaarii, a ɓaah ŋ ƴaaɓiŋ ɗe. » <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Waaye Piyeer taaskissa. Wa degga ƴissuut, ƴaaɓa nikee ndaam nammba ɗe woo ne : « Fu ɓo' Galile, wa keeh ne fu ɓaah ŋ ƴaaɓiŋ ɗe. » <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Piyeer giñeeɗa, a woosa ne : « Ŋ lee ɗah, Kooh alkaat to, waaye ŋ inahɗi ƴaari ɗu na woye. »<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Weɗi siika kanakɗukoh leehuk. A naandsukka findi Yeesu woyohee ɗe wa ne : « Bala siiki leehkan waas kanak ɗah, fu hey yo taaske waas kaahay. » Jaarra, a fuɗeeɗa.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓayuuɗ ŋ Pilaat ne a atte'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa teel, kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> cohha na jangɗohoh caŋ wa, na yakak ca, na <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ atte'oh ci">saangnaŋ atte'oh ca</char> jen. Ɓa tokɗukka Yeesu, ɓa ɓayya ɗe ŋ Pilaat.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Wa ɓa ree, Pilaat meekissa ɗe ne : « A fu buuriŋ Yawuut ci e ? » Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fu woyiɗa ! » <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa yambeeɗa ɗe in laayiɗ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilaat woyissa ɗe ne : « Fu lofanɗi e ? Fu kerahɗi in ci laayiɗ ci ɓa na yambee ɗa e ? » <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Waaye Yeesu lofisɗi ali in ; ineem feyya Pilaat.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Waam, feet <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> reyeen ɗah, Pilaat faɗsiɗ ɓa ambuuɗ yino ŋ ɓa nik ŋ kasoona, ɓeɗ na tanootee ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Wa raakeen ƴaar teeku Barabaas ; a ɓaahee ŋ ɓa hiñohee na nguura. Wa kurka yoond, ɓa apee ɓo', ɓa taƴuusa ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mboolnda kaɗta ŋ Pilaat, ɓa woyeeɗa ɗe ne : « Haɓɗiɗa ɓoo ini fu na cure ɓoo tumiɗ kiis nu ree. » <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilaat loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu waaɗ ne ŋ faɗsiɗ ɗu buuriŋ Yawuut ci e ? » <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />A inheen ne waaɗa ɓooɓa waaɗ Yeesu, weɗ tah po kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa degga ɗe ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Waaye ɓa yoppa mboolnda ne ɓa woyaat ne : Barabaas ! <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilaat woyissa ɓa ne : « Moo ɗu waaɗ ne ŋ tum ƴaari ɗu teek buuriŋ Yawuut ci na ? » <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ɓa leehkisseeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa ! » <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />A meekissa ɓa ne : « A haɓiɗ ye in moɗaaɗi ? » Waaye ɓa uupeeɗa nga leehuk ŋ ɗafka an : « Daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa ! » <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilaat waaɗta jam, a taambiɗta mboolnda ŋ ini neɓ ɓa ; a faɗsiɗta ɓa Barabaas, a nakohha Yeesu laɓu na leraw po ƴutta, a eɗta soldaar ca ɗe ne ɓa daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Ɓa ɓayya ɗe leero kahan goornoor, ɓa ɓeeɗukka soldaar ca ɓinooɓa jen. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ɓa ɓekiɗta ɗe kulɓa ruumind po haa buur, ɓa teɗta ñapir, ɓa ɓekiɗta ɗe wa ŋ haf findi mbahne-buur. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ɓa kañɗeeɗa ɗe an : « Ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗa buuriŋ Yawuut ci. » <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ɓa laɓeeɗa ɗe ŋ haf na ngeer, ɓa tuhseeɗa ɗe, ɓa ƴekeeɗa ŋ fikiice. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Wa ɓa njembit ɗe po ƴutta, ɓa wolla kulɓaaka ɓa ɓekɗee ɗe, ɓa ɓekɗissa ɗe kulɓaacaŋ ɗe, ɓa ɓayeeɗa ɗe bilaf fa ne ɓa daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu daaƴuuɗ ŋ kurwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Waam raak ƴaar gen Sireen teeku Simong, baabiŋ Aleksaandar na Rufus, a pulohee ɓak caŋ yohon ca, a lahha ndaam, ɓa tufukka ɗe ne a deguk kurwaaniŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ɓa ɓayya Yeesu po ŋ ɗiska na woyse <char style="tl">Golgota</char>, wa tokis "Ƴoh-haf", <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />ɓa waaɗta ɗe anɗukoh biiñ ambsohuuɗ na <char style="tl">miir</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">miir</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa cuuraay, wa na fuuɗseeɗi. Wa na woyse "<char style="tl">myrrhe</char>" ŋ farañse.</char></note>, waaye a anɗi. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ƴutta, soldaar ca daaƴca ɗe ŋ kurwaa, ɓa piilohha kulɓaacaŋ ɗe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Sabuur 22:19</ref></char></note> ne yaa nu nga ɗah inah ini a joy raak. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Wa raak yoor-yoora aaseeɗa. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Raakka ina ɓa fiis ndaam, ne wa teeɓoh ini tah ɗe daaƴu. Ɓa fiisee inii : « Buuriŋ Yawuut ci. »<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Yeesu daaƴsee na rokoh kanak, yii lahha ɗe yaah-ñaahum, yum yaah-sing. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Ineem raakka ne ina Fiis ca woyee raak, an : « A ɓaahndohuuɗ ŋ tumoh moɗaaɗiica. »" (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Esayi 53:12</ref></char>). Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ɓooɓa taambee ŋ ɗiska njembteeɗa ɗe, ɓa kuɗteeɗa haf, ɓa ɓaseeɗa ɗe an : « Ngec ! Fu yi woyee ne, fu hey yahrohe <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahniŋ Kooh</char>, fu taɓahisa ŋ neeh kaahay, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />mucɗa haf fu, fu ruhus ŋ kurwaani <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Sabuur 22:8</ref></char></note>! » <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa ŋ harmban ɓa, na jangɗohoh caŋ wa nameeɗa ɗe njembit an : « A mucɗiɗ ɓinooɓi, a minɗi muciɗ haf ce ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" /><char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, buuriŋ Israayel, ruhsaat ŋ kurwaani win-win, ɓoo hot, ɓoo han kos. » Ɓa daaƴsee na ɗe nameeɗa ɗe ɓas.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaanaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Wa njooloora ree, kehƴi jen nikka ŋ ñuus ini ree wahtu kaahay. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Wa wahtu ceem mit, Yeesu leehukka ŋ ɗafka, a woosa ne : « Eloyi ! Eloyi ! Lema sabahtani ? » weɗ ne "Koohiŋ ngo ! Koohiŋ ngo ! Wa ye tah fu faɗta so ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Sabuur 22:2</ref></char></note>" <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ ɓa nikee ŋ ndaam kerahhaa, ɓa woosa ne : « Kerhaat, a na ɓeeɗke <char style="w">Ilyas</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ilyas </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: tiikiŋ "Ilyas" na tiikiŋ "Eloyi", findi ɓa na woyohee ca, ca reɓ reɓ mand.</char></note> ! » <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ƴaar nga ɓa nuppa, ɓayya daah, a hooƴcaa ŋ masuɓ raakiɗ <char style="tl">bineegar</char>, a tokkaa ŋ lecem ndooɗ, a deggaa ŋ nguɓiŋ Yeesu ne a an. Ƴaara woosa ne : « Sekaat ɓoo marak, andi Ilyas hey ɗe hee ruhsiɗe ŋ kurwaani. »<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yeesu leehukka, nguɗta. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ridoona ɗasɗee <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaanaŋ</char> Kahnaŋ Kooh faarukka tareet ini kooɗoh ɗafka po kehƴa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Pula 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca, ya tufkee ŋ fiki Yeesu, hotta findi a kaanoh, a woosa ne : « Wa keeh ne ƴaarii nikee <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓu Kooh</char>. »<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Raakeen ɓitiɓ ca tufkee usiɗ markeeɗa. Mari Makdala ɓaahee nga na Salome na Mari yi yaay ɓi Yoose na Saak yi ƴini. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ ñaakɗee Yeesu te ɓeɗ meeɗ ɗe taambkoh wa a nik ŋ Galile. Nameen raak ɓitiɓ wiiriis laayiɗ, ɓaah ŋ ɓa hunee na ɗe Yerusalem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗaakuukaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Ŋ noh niinɗaŋ mbehi na kooɗkohse, wi adug <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:42-43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, wa na cambe juma na niin, weɗ ne muyohaaɗ-nohaŋ mbehi na kooɗkohse, wa reeh ŋ gaaw ne noha muyeeɗa.</char></note>, Suseef ya genee Arimate hayya. A nikee ɓo' yeguuɗ ŋ atte'oh ca te a yi ŋ haf ce, a namee sek Nguuriŋ-Kooh. Hooɓa wa kee hooɓa tahha po a kaɗta ŋ Pilaat na fit, a meekissa ɗe fiɗaafa. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilaat feyuusa wi a kerah ne Yeesu ariɗ kaan, a nakohha ɓeeɗkiɗu ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca, a meekissa ɗe andi a ɓaatsiɗiɗ kaan. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilaat kerahha ini yeem lof, a teyɗukiɗta Suseef ne a ɓayaat fiɗaafa.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Suseef rommba uuf <char style="tl"><char style="w">leeŋ</char></char>, a ruhsiɗta faanaŋ Yeesu ŋ ɗiska wa daaƴsee ; a lemessaa na uufa, a ɓekkaa ŋ ruy-ruy huruuɗ ŋ atoh. Ƴutta, a pilnginnda atoh yakak, a ranngaa naa. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Raak Mari Makdala na Mari yaay ɓi Yoose nga, ɓa markeeɗa ŋ ɗiska Yeesu ɗaaku.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu hultiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Wa nohi muy po <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> reehha, Mari Makdala na Salome na Mari yaay ɓi Saak rommba eeñɗoha ne ɓa reefa fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina na ɓaaɓa teel, wa ɓitiɓ ceem reyee ruy-ruya, raak nohi haneeɗa pul. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Moo ! Ya ɓa na hee ɓoo pilnginɗe atoh fa rangohu ruy-ruya ? » <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ɓa jaɗtukka, ɓa hotta ne atoh fa rangee wa pilnginuuɗ te wa nikee atoh yakoh na yakoh.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ɓa aassa ŋ ruy-ruya, ɓa hotta fiir ɓekkiɗ sabidoor yaanow melciɗ, ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɓaka ñaahma, ɓa feyuusa jameet. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Waaye, ƴaara woosa ɓa ne : « Kanaat feyu, ɗu na marke Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet, yi daaƴse ŋ kurwaa. A hultiɗuuɗ, a nikisɗi ndii, ɗiski a ɗaaksee weɗɗi. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ɗiski wa nik, kaɗaat ɗu woya taalubeeci, Piyeer na ɓinooɓi, ne a yaa adug ɗu Galile. Ɗu na hee ɗe hotohe ndaam findi a woyohee ɗu wa. » <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ɓa pulla ruy-ruya, ɓa saandoheeɗa. Ɓa nikee saakɗoheeɗa sagu tiit, neƴƴoheem tahha po ɓa wooɗi ali ɓo' in.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aaya 9-20, e Maarko fiis ca haa. Ɓo' inahɗi andi a rawɗi ɗiindoh teerndiŋ ɗe, andi ini a fiis muuƴ muuƴ. Kon, aayaacii, ɓi ɓo' wiiriis fiis ca. Ca fiis maañiɗ, ca fiisu ŋ finho hayiŋ Yeesu, bala kiis 150 reyan ɗah, te in ci ca woo, ca hun na in ci Luk na Macce na Saaŋ fiis.</char></note>Wa Yeesu hulit ŋ mbehi koc na ɓaaɓa, a ɗeɓ teeɓ haf ce Mari Makdala. A yi ɓitɓa a saɓsohee na <char style="w">jiini</char> yasna-kanak. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Yeem kaɗta, a raakka ɓa meeɗ hun na Yeesu fuɗeeɗa kakaan kiŋ ɗe ; a naandsukka ɓa wa. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Waaye, wa a woo ɓa ne : « Yeesu hultiɗ, ŋ hotiɗ ɗe ! » Ɓa kosɗi ɗe. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ƴutta, Yeesu teeɓkissa taalube kanak, ŋ ñaamaar ɗalohiɗ na wa koc, raak ɓa ŋ waas ŋ bilaf fa. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ɓa hayya, ɓa naandsukkaa taalubeeca ɓinooɓa, waaye ɓa namɗaa kos. <verse eid="MRK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ŋ mirndaani, a teeɓukka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na yinooci (11), raak ɓa ɓoofiɗ ñameeɗa. A ngassa ɓa ŋ ndengkiŋ ɓa keeñ na ini ɓa kosɗi ɓooɓi hot ɗe hultiɗuuɗ.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />A hannda ɓa woo ne : « Kaɗaat ŋ adinaani jen, ɗu woo ɓooɓi feru jen <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yaa nu kos te a ɓoktu ɗah, a hey muce, waaye yaa nu kosɗi ɗah, a hey atte'se findi bakaaɗoh. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Te in ci ɓooɓi kosan ndo inhisohsan ceɗi cii : Ɓa hey aañe jiini ŋ tiikiŋ ngo, ɓa jombee ɓi peɗeem as, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />ali ɓa amb iiñ wala ɓa an posani na ape sah, ali in rahsanɗi ɓa. Ɓa hey dege kosaayiɗ ci yaah, ɓa wir. »<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Wa Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu ƴut ɓa woo in ceem, a rapɗuusa ŋ Eel ca, a ɓooffa ŋ ñaahmaŋ Kooh. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Taalubeeci woosa Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ɗisik nu nik, Heɗ ɓoo ambɗohha ɓa ŋ pangkeem, in ci feyohiɗ ci a haɓɗee ɗisik nu ɓa kaɗ ɗah, ca teeɓohha ne woo kiŋ ɓa, wa keeh.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>